<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">MAT-POGORO</book>
  <para style="h">MATENDU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matendu ga Wantumintumi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matendu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mate</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATENDU GA WANTUMINTUMI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shintola sha Matendu ga wantumintumi ndo matakuliru ga wantu yawamjimira Yesu ntambu yawanjiti kuwera pasipanu na kweneya kwanjira Yerusalemu mpaka Yudeya na Samaliya na kumonga, Yesu ntambu yakawagambiriti wantumintumi wakuwi pamberi hakenigendi kumpindi, (Matendu 1:8). Shintola ashi shilembitwi na Luka, ndo ulaa yakalembiti Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Luka. Yomberi ndo bwana mganga na kaloliti weri kulemba kwa unakaka vitwatira ntambu yavilawiriti mumakaliru ga Yesu. Shintola ashi sha matendu ga wantumintumi pamuhera na shilii sha Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Luka, vyoseri avi kamlemberiti Teofili yakaweriti Muyunani, kumbiti iwezekana kuwera nfiru ya vintola avi iweriti vibetulwi na wantu woseri, Wayunani na Wayawudi (1:1).</para>
  <para style="ip">Shintola sha Matendu ga wantumintumi pamonga shilembitwi mushinja sha malongu sita mpaka shinja sha malongu sita na msheshi Pakwiyuka Yesu, toziya upeleru wa shintola shilanguziya Paulu hakenivugulilwi mushibetubetu. Viraa Luka kagenditi mwanja pamuhera na ntumintumi Paulu na pamonga kalembiti shintola sha matendu mulushi lwa Antiokiya, shintola ashi sha Matendu ndo mwendelezu gwa Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Luka na shanjiti kwa Yesu kugenda kumpindi. Nfiru nkulu ya Luka ya kulemba shintola ashi ndo ilifana nentu handa su yakaweriti nayu pakaweriti kankulemba Shisoweru Shiwagira. Yomberi kamfiriti Teofili pamuhera kwongereka kwa wantu yawamjimiriti Yesu waweriti na unakaka kwa galii gawafunditwi na hangu kalembiti kwa unakaka vitwatira vyoseri vyavilawiliti mumakaliru ga Yesu na kweneya kwa njimiru ya kumjimira Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shintola ashi shitupanana mifanu ya wantu wa kwanja yawamjimiriti Yesu ntambu yawaweriti na mana ya kulikala munjimiru ya kumjimira Yesu. Mifanu ya wantumintumi itulanguziya twenga ntambu ya kutumbira likakala lya Rohu Mnanagala mukweneza ujumbi wa Shisoweru Shiwagira kwa wamonga.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagaweramu</para>
  <para style="io">Kwanja Rohu Mnanagala kankuwasulukira wafundwa na wantu yawamjimira Yesu wankwanja kwongereka, shipandi sha 1:1-8:1</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu wantu yawamjimira Yesu wapingikwa na kwanja kweneya kuisi yamonga kutali na Yerusalemu, shipandi sha 8:2-12:23</para>
  <para style="io">Pa aga Paulu kankugenda mwanja gwakuwi gwa kwanja gwa umisiyoni, shipandi sha 12:24-14:28</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu shiyotera motu shankuliwona Kuyerusalemu kwamuwa shishi shifiruwa kwa wantu wa syayi yawamjimira Yesu, shipandi sha 15:1-35</para>
  <para style="io">Su Paulu kagenda mwanja gwakuwi gwa pili gwa umisiyoni, shipandi sha 15:36-18:22</para>
  <para style="io">Paulu kagenda mwanja gwakuwi gwa tatu gwa umisiyoni, shipandi sha 18:23-26:38</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu Paulu kankukamulwa Yerusalemu, shipandi sha 21mpaka shipandi sha 26.</para>
  <para style="io">Upeleru Paulu kankujegwa kugenda Rumi, shipandi sha 27 mpaka shipandi sha 28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Mtuwa Teufili</para>
  <para style="p">Mtuwa Teufili, <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Mlongu Teufili, mushintola sha kwanja nembiti kuusu vitwatira vyoseri Yesu vyakatenditi na kufunda kwanjira kwanja. <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />Mpaka lishaka lilii pakanyasulitwi kugenda kumpindi kwa Mlungu. Pamberi pa kunyasulwa kugenda kumpindi, kawapananiti malagaliru kupitira Rohu Mnanagala wantumintumi walii yakawasyaguliti. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Pakuhowa kwakuwi, yomberi kalilanguziyiti mweni kwa womberi na kulilanguziya nakaka kuwera mweni kamkomu. Yomberi kawalawiriti kwa shaka sha mashaka malongu msheshi na yomberi kayoweriti nawu kuusu Ufalumi wa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Shaka shimu yomberi pakaweriti nawu, kawapananiti lagaliru ali, “Namlawa amu Yerusalemu, su muliheperi lagilu lya Tati, lilii lyampikaniriti neni nonga kuusu visoweru vyakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Toziya Yohani kawabatiziti kwa mashi, kumbiti pa mashaka gavuwa ndiri mwenga hamubatizwi kwa Rohu Mnanagala.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankunyasulwa kugenda kumpindi kwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Su wantumintumi pawaliwoniti pamuhera na Yesu, womberi wamkosiyiti, “Mtuwa, shaka ashi haguwuziyi ufalumi kwa Israeli?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yesu kawagambira, “Vyamwenga ndiri kuvimana vipindi ama zitarehi Tati gwangu kavitula muukolamlima wakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Kumbiti hamwanki likakala Rohu Mnanagala pakawayizireni mwenga, na hamuweri wapitawu waneni Muyerusalemu na Muyudeya yoseri na Samariya na ata upeleru wa pasipanu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Pakatakuliti kala aga, pawaweriti wankulola yomberi kanyasulitwi kugenda kumpindi kwa Mlungu, liwundu limfifa nawamwona kayi. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Pawaweriti wankali wankulola kumpindi yomberi kwakagenditi, palaa paliya wantu wawili yawavaliti nguwu nvufu wagolokiti pakwegela nawomberi, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />na walonga, “Mwenga wantu wa Galilaya! Iwera hashi mgoloka panu pamlola kumpindi? Yesu ayu, yakanyasulitwi kulawa kwa mwenga kugenda kumpindi, hakizi kayi kwa njira iraa ayi ntambu yamumwoniti pakagenda kumpindi kwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matiya wankumsyagula katendi lihengu lya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Shakapanu wantumintumi wawuyiti Yerusalemu kulawa kulugongu lwa Mizeyituni, kuweriti kilumita yimu kulawa mlushi. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Pawasokiti mlushi, wayingiriti mshumba shawalikaliti, nawomberi waweriti Peteru na Yohani na Yakobu na Andereya na Filipu na Tomasi na Batolumayu na Matayu, Yakobu mwana gwa Alifayu na Simoni Zeloti na Yuda mwana gwa Yakobu. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Womberi woseri waliwoniti shipinga pamuhera kumluwa Mlungu, pamuhera na wadala na Mariya mawu gwa Yesu na walongu wakuwi Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Mumashaka galii Peteru kagolokiti pakati pa wantu yawamjimira Kristu, weni walanga yawu waweriti miya yimu na malongu mawili, su yomberi kalongiti. <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Mwawalongu wangu, Malembu Mananagala gatimiya, geni Rohu Mnanagala katungiti kupitira Dawudi kuusu Yuda yakawalongoziyiti walii yawamkamuliti Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yuda kaweriti yumu gwa shipinga shetu, toziya mweni kasyagulitwi kaweri mtenda lihengu muyetu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Su Yuda kahemeliti lirambu kwa mpiya zilii za ukondola zyakazipatiti, pakaweriti kulirambu yomberi kaguwiti na kahowa, kapantika na utumbu wakuwi witika kunja. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Kila muntu yakalikaliti Muyerusalemu kapikaniriti visoweru vya vitwatira avi, na kwa likabira lyawu lirambu ali walishema Akelidama, mana yakuwi “Lirambu lya Mwazi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Peteru kalongiti, “Ilembwa mushintora sha Zaburi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Numba yakuwi isigali hera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">muntu yoseri nakalikala amu.’</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 1:20" />
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Kayi ilembwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Muntu yumonga katoli lihengu lyakuwi.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />“Su ifiruwa tumsyaguli muntu yumonga pakati pa walii yawaweriti pamuhera na twenga shaka shoseri mtuwa Yesu pakingiriti na kulawa pakati penu. <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />Kwanjira kwa shaka sha ubatizu wa Yohani mpaka lishaka lilii Yesu pakanyasulitwi kulawa kwatwenga kugenda kumpindi. Ifiruwa yumu gwawu kaweri kapitawu gwa kuzyuka kwakuwi pamhera natwenga.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Su wakanda matawu ga wantu wawili, Yosefu yawamshema Barisaba viraa yomberi kamanikana kwa litawu lya Yustu, na Matiya. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Shakapanu wamluwa Mlungu, “Mtuwa, gwenga guyimana myoyu ya wantu woseri. Su gutulanguziyi pakati pa wawili awa ulii yagumsyaguliti, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />katoli lihengu lya utenderu wa untumintumi wa Yuda yakaulekiti su kagendi pahala pakuwi mweni.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Shakapanu wagalambuziya simbi na kugalambuziya simbi aku kumtulukiriti Matiya, nayomberi kayongerwa mushipinga sha wantumintumi lilongu na yumu.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Rohu Mnanagala kankwiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Lishaka lya Pentekosti palisokiti, woseri waweriti wajojinikiti pahala pamuhera. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Vumu liziwu gambira lyega lipikinika kulawa kuliyera na limemiziyiti numba yoseri yawalikaliti. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Womberi wawoniti vintu gambira mimbemba ya motu yaibagulikiti na kamkangalira kila muntu. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Woseri wamemiziyitwi Rohu Mnanagala na wanjiti kutakula kwa luga zya makabira gamonga, Rohu ntambu yakawatenditi watakuli.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Vinu palii Yerusalemu kuweriti na Wayawudi, wantu yawamguwira Mlungu, wantu yawalawiti kila isi pasi pa mpindi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Womberi pawapikaniriti liziwu ali, lipinga likulu lya wantu lijojinikiti pamuhera walikangasha, toziya kila yumu gwawu kawapikaniriti womberi wankutakula kwa luga ya likabila lyakuwi mweni. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Womberi wasintuka na kulikangasha pawalikosiya, “Hashi, wantu awa ntambu yawatakula Wagalilaya ndiri? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Iwera hashi, kila yumu gwetu kankuwapikinira pawatakula kwa luga yakuwi mweni? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Wamu wetu ndo Wapariti na Wamediya na Waelami, wamonga walawa Misopotamiya na Yudeya na Kapadokiya na Pontu na Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />na Firigiya na Pamfiliya na Misri na kumikowa ya Libya pakwegera na Kureni. Wamonga wahenga kulawa Rumi, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Wayawudi na wantu yawagalambukiriti dini ya Shiyawudi na wamonga walawa Kureti na Arabiya. Twawoseri twenga tupikanira pawatakula kwa luga zya makabila getu twaweni kuusu vitwatira vikulu Mlungu vyakatenditi!” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Walikangasha na kuhinginika, wankulikosiyana weni gweka, “Mana yakuwi shii?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Kumbiti wamonga watenda lidufiya pawalonga, “Wantu awa walowera ujimbi!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi wa Peteru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Shakapanu Peteru kagolokiti pamuhera na wantumintumi walii lilongu na yumu, kanja kulibwelera lipinga lilii lya wantu, “Walongu Wayawudi na woseri mwenga yamulikala Yerusalemu, mpikaniri weri shilii shanonga.” <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Wantu awa walowera ndiri ujimbi ntambu yamulihola, toziya ayi ndo saa tatu hera mandawira! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Unakaka ndo awu shitwatira ashi ndo shirii shakatakuliti mbuyi gwa Mlungu Yoweli,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Hantendi mumashaka ga kupelera, Mlungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Hanuwamiminiri wantu woseri Rohu gwangu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Wananguta wenu wapalu na wadala, waubweri ujumbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Wandemba hawawoni mawonu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Na wazewi wenu hawaloti.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Yina, ata wantumintumi wangu, wapalu na wadala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Hanuwamiminiri Rohu gwangu mulishaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Na womberi hawaubweri ujumbi waneni.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Handendi mauzauza kumpindi kuliyera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Na lilangaliru pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">Hakuweri na mwazi, motu na lyosi lizotopa,<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Mshenji gutulwa nditi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Na lyezi haliweri lisheri handa mwazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Pamberi pa lishaka likulu na weru wa Mtuwa kwiza.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Panu, yoseri yakafira kuluwa kwa litawu lya Mtuwa, hakalopoziwi’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Wana isi wa Israeli, mpikaniri shisoweru ashi! Yesu gwa Nazareti kaweriti muntu na ukulu wakuwi wa Umlungu ulanguziwa kwa mwenga kwa mauzauza, makangashu na langaliru Mlungu lyakatenditi pakati penu kwa njira yakuwi, handa ntambu yamumana. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Kugenderana na mpangu gwakuwi mweni Mlungu kaamuwiti kala handa Yesu mewamubati, mwenga mumlaga kwa kuwalekera wantu wadoda wampingiki. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Kumbiti Mlungu kamzyukisiya kulawa kwawahowiti, kamlopoziya mukutama kwa kuhowa kwa mana iwezekana ndiri nakamu kuhowa kumtatiri <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Mana Dawudi katakuliti kuusu yomberi hangu, Numwoniti Mtuwa kuulongolu kwa neni mashaka goseri, ka pamu na neni uwega wangu wa kumliwu, ata hapeni ndikinyiki. <verse eid="ACT 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Hangu, moyu gwangu gwasekuseku, kayi ntenditi lusheka lya nemeleru. Nshimba ya neni hayilikali mlitumbiru, <verse eid="ACT 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Toziya hapeni guyileki rohu yaneni kulirindi lyalihera upeleru, pota kumleka mnanagala gwaku kawoli. <verse eid="ACT 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Gunanguziyi njira za ukomu, kuweri kwakuwi gumemiziya sekuseku!<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Mwalongu wangu, nfira kuwagambirani shinagaubaga kuusu vitwatira vyavimpatiti Dawudi, mbuyi gwetu. Yomberi kahowiti, wamsira, kayi lipumba lyakuwi lyapalapanu pa twenga mpaka lelu. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Kumbiti yomberi kaweriti mbuyi gwa Mlungu na kavimaniti kuwera Mlungu kamlagiliti kwa shirapu kuwera hakampanani yumu gwa mwiwuku gwakuwi ukolamlima ntambu yakaweriti Dawudi. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Dawudi kaviwoniti pamberi vitwatira Mlungu vyakagenda kuvitenda, su yomberi kayoweriti kuusu uzyukisiya wa Kristu pakatakuliti, ‘Kalekitwi ndiri mulirindi lyalihera upeleru, ama nshimba yakuwi iwoliti ndiri.’ <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Su, Mlungu kamzyukisiyiti Yesu ayu na twawoseri twenga ndo wakapitawu wa lilawiru ali. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Yesu wamnyasuliti kumpindi mpaka uwega wa kumliwu wa Mlungu, yomberi kawanka lagilu lya Rohu Mnanagala kulawa kwa Tati na kashimiminira shilii shamushiwona vinu na kushipikinira. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Mana Dawudi mweni, kakwena haa mpaka kumpindi, ila yomberi kalongiti, Mtuwa kamgambiriti Mtuwa gwangu, Gulikali uwega wangu wa kumliwu, <verse eid="ACT 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />Mpaka nuwatendi wankondu waku waweri shiti sha magulu gaku. <verse eid="ACT 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Wantu woseri wa Israeli wafiruwa kuvimana kwa nakaka handa Yesu ayu yampingikiti, ndomweni Mlungu kamtenda kuwera mtuwa na Kristu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Su, wantu pawapikaniriti aga, walunguziwitwi moyu, wawakosiyiti Peteru na wantumintumi wayaguwi, “Walongu wetu, tutendi shishi?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Peteru kankula, “Mtubu na kila yumu gwenu kabatizwi kwa litawu lya Yesu Kristu su mpati kuwusiya vidoda vyenu na kwanga kwayidi kwa Rohu Mnanagala.<verse eid="ACT 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />“Toziya lagilu alii ndo kwajili ya mwenga na wana wenu na kwa wantu woseri yawawera kutali, kwa ntambu ya woseri yawalikala patali, na kwa wantu woseri Mtuwa Mlungu gwetu hakawashemi kwakuwi.” <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Kwa shisoweru shingi kayi shitangala, Peteru kasisitiziti na kuwahimiziya wantu pakalonga, “Mlilopoziyi mushiyiwuku ashi shikondola.”<verse eid="ACT 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Wavuwa wavijimiriti visoweru vyakuwi, wabatizwa. Wantu elufu tatu wongerekiti mushipinga shili lishaka ali. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Woseri awa wendereyiti kulifunda kulawa kwa wantumintumi, kulikala pamuhera shilongu, kumega libumunda na kumluwa Mlungu.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makaliru ga kila lishaka ga walii yawamjimira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Mauzauza na makangashu gavuwa gatendikiti kupitira wantumintumi ata kila muntu kawera na lyoga. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Woseri yawajimira wendereyiti weri shintu shimu na lunda zawu wagawaniti pamuhera. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Waweriti wankuwuza lunda na vintu vyawu shakapanu wagawana mpiya shiyasi ya nfiru ya kila yumu. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Wendereyiti kuliwona pamuhera kila lishaka Munumba nkulu ya Mlungu. Kumbiti shaka sha kumega libumunda, waliwoniti mnumba zyawu na waliya pamuhela shiboga ashi kwa sekuseku na moyu guherepa. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Wamkwisiti Mlungu, wafiruwa na wantu woseri. Kila lishaka Mtuwa kawayongeleriti walanga ya wantu yawaweriti wankulopoziwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Peteru kankumponiziya mluwa shibyeketu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Lishaka limu Peteru na Yohani wagenditi Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu shaka sha saa tisa paliwala, shaka sha kusali. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Paweriti na Ligomi Liherepa, muntu yumu shibyeketu kwanjira kwiwuka. Wantu hawa waweriti wankumpapa muntu ayu kila lishaka kumjega kuligomi kuluwa mpiya kwa wantu yawingira kunumba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Pakawawoniti Peteru na Yohani wankwingira Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, shibyeketu ulii kawaluwiti wampanani shintu. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Peteru pamuhera na Yohani wamjodolera masu, na Peteru kamgambira, “Gutuloli!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Su kawagalambukira, pakalolelera kupananwa shintu kulawa kwawomberi. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Kumbiti Peteru kamgambira, “Nahera mpiya, kumbiti shirii shamweri nashu hanukupanani, kwa litawu lya Yesu Kristu gwa Nazareti nukugambira gugoloki na gugendigendi!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Shakapanu kamkola liwoku lya kumliwu na kamgolosiya. Palaa palii magulu na manung'unu gakuwi gapata likakala. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Kakopoka, kagoloka na kwanja kugendagenda. Shakapanu kingira pamuhera nawomberi Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, pakagendagenda na kukopokakopoka na pakamkwisa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Wantu woseri yawamwoniti kankugendagenda na kumkwisa Mlungu, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />na pawavimaniti weri ndo ulii yakaweriti kankuluwaluwa pakwegera na Mlyangu Guherepa gulii gwa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu, woseri walikangasha nentu, su waweziti ndiri kuvimana vyavimpatiti.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi wa Peteru Munumba ngulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Muntu yakaponiziwitwi na Peteru na Yohani pamdamu gwa Selemani, Wantu woseri, waweriti wankulikangasha, wanja kumtugira. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Shaka Peteru pakawawoniti wantu awa kawagambira, “Wenikaya wa Israeli, ntambu gaa mkangashwa na shitwatira ashi? iwera hashi mwankutujodolera masu gambira kwa likakala lyetu ama unanagala wetu twaweni tumtenda muntu ayu kawezi kugendagenda? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Mlungu gwa Aburahamu na Isaka na Yakobu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wetu kamkwisa ntumintumi gwakuwi Yesu. Kumbiti ndomweni ula ulii yakakamlitwi na wakulu na kumlema kuulongolu kwa Pilatu, ata pa Pilatu kuamuwa kumlekeziya. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Kaweriti mnanagala na yakamfiriziya Mlungu, kumbiti mwenga mulemiti, na mmufira muntu gwingi kayi yakaweriti kalaga kumlekiziya. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Su, mumlagiti ulii yomberi ndo shanjiru sha ukomu. Kumbiti Mlungu kamzyukisiyiti kulawa kwa wahowiti na twenga ndo wakapitawu wa shitwatira ashi. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Litawu lya Yesu na moyu mulitawu ali ndo vyavimupiti likakala muntu ayu yamumwona na kumana. Njimiru kwa Yesu ndo imuponiziyiti nakamu muntu ayu ntambu yamuviwona mwawoseri.”<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Vinu mwalongu wangu Israeli, nuvimana handa mwenga na wakulu wenu mtenditi aga kwa Yesu toziya ya kuvimanandiri kwenu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Kumbiti avi Mlungu gakatimiziti galaa gakabweriti makashu kwa njira ya wambuyi woseri, handa iweriti mpaka Kristu gwakuwi katabiki. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Su, mleki vidoda vyamtenditi, mumuwuyiri Mlungu gwenu su yomberi kafuti vidoda vyenu. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Mtendaga hangu su Mtuwa kawapanani shaka sha sekuseku murohu na kuwajegera ula Kristu yakamsyaguliti yomberi ndo Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Ifiruwa yomberi kasigali aku kumpindi mpaka pashisoka shaka kulekibishwa vintu vyoseri, handa Mlungu ntambu yakatakuliti kwa njira ya wambuyi wakuwi wananagala kwanjira makashu. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Toziya Musa katakuliti, Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawajegerani mbuyi handa neni kulawa pakati penu maweni. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Yoseri ulii hapeni kamupikiniri mbuyi gwa Mlungu ayu hakatulwi kutali na wantu wa Mlungu na kuagamiziwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Wambuyi woseri wa Mlungu, kwanjira Samweli na walii yawamfatiti, wabweriti visoweru vya vitwatira avi vyeni viweriti vyankutendeka mashaka aga. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Malagiru galii Mlungu kagalaviyiti kwa njira ya Wambuyi ndo kwajili ya mwenga, na mtenda pamuhera lipatanu Mlungu lyakatenditi na mbuyi gwetu, handa ntambu yakamgambiriti Aburahamu. Kwa njira ya wiwuka waku, wantu woseri wa pasipanu hawatekelerwi. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Su, Mlungu kamzyukisiyiti ntumintumi gwakuwi kwa mota yenu kwanja, kamtuma kawajegeri matekeleru kwa kumtenda kila yumu gwenu kalekani nakamu na vidoda vyakuwi.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Peteru na Yohani wankuwajega kushiyotera motu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Peteru na Yohani pawaweriti wankali wankuwabwelera wantu, watambika na wakulu wa walolera wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu pamwera na Masadukayu wiziti. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Wakalaliti nentu, toziya wantumintumi awa waweriti wankuwabwelera wantu kuwera Yesu kazyukiti, shitwatira sheni shilanguziya pota kufifa handa wahowiti hawazyuki. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Su, wawaturiti mlikakala na toziya pashiru paweriti pakwegera, wawaturiti mkulolerwa mpaka shirawu yakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Kumbiti wavuwa pakati pa walii yawapikaniriti ujumbi wawu wajimiriti na walanga ya wawajimira iwera yongereka wapalu elufu mhanu. <verse eid="ACT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Shirawu yakuwi, watuwa wa Wayawudi, wazewi na wafunda wa malagaliru wajojinika pamwera aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Waliwoniti pamuhera na Anasi mtambika mkulu, Kayafa na Yohani na Alekizanda na wamonga yawaweriti wa lukolu lwa mtambika mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Pawawagolisiyiti wantumintumi kuulongolu kwawu, wawakosiyiti, “Mwenga mtenda shitwatira ashi kwa likakala lyoshi na kwa litawu lya gaa?” <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Panu, Peteru, pakawera kamemiziwa na Rohu Mnanagala, kawagambira, “Walongoziya na wazewi wa wantu! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Handa pamtukosiya leru kuusu shilii shitendu shiheri shakatenderitwi ulii muntu yakaweriti shibyeketu na ntambu yakaponiziwitwi, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Su, mwenga na wantu woseri wa Israeli mfiruwa kuvimana kuusu muntu ayu kagoloka kulongolu kwamwenga leru, mkomu nakamu, kwa likakala lya litawu lyakuwi Yesu Kristu gwa Nazareti yomberi mwenga mmupingika, kumbiti Mlungu kamzyukisiya kulawa kwa wahowiti. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Ayu ndomweni Malembu Mananagala gatakula, Libuwi lyamuliremiti mwenga wanyawa numba, vinu liwera Libuwi likulu lya liyanjiru <verse eid="ACT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Ulopoziya upatikana ndiri kwa muntu gwingi yoseri, toziya kwahera litawu limonga pasi pa mpindi, wantu wawapanana ndiri litawu lya muntu gwingi mweni twenga tuweza kulopuziwa na yomberi.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Awa wazewi Pashiyotera motu , waweriti wavimana handa Peteru na Yohani waweriti wantu wahera shisomu pota elimu yoseri, walikangasha ntambu yawatakuliti kwa ugangamala. Wavimana handa waweriti wapamwera na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Kumbiti pawamwoniti muntu ulii yawamponiziyiti kagoloka pamwera nawomberi, waweza ndiri kutakula shintu. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Hangu, wawagambiriti walawi kunja kumdamu, na womberi wasigala mnumba pawatakula kwa kupwepa. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Walikosiana, “Tutendi shishi na wantu awa? Kila muntu yakalikala Yerusalemu kavimana handa mauzauza aga gakulikangasha gatendeka, natwenga tuwezandiri kulema shitwatira ashi. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Kumbiti su tupati kubera shitwatira ashi nashiendereya nentu pakati pa wantu, tuwakalipiri nawayowera na muntu yoseri kwa litawu lya Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Hangu wawashema kayi mngati, wawaberiziya nawayowera kayi paweru, na kufunda kwa litawu lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Kumbiti Peteru na Yohani wawankula, “Mwamuwi mwenga handa ndo teratera kuulongolu kwa Mlungu kuwajimira mwenga kuliku kumjimira Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Toziya tuwezandiri kuleka kutakula kuusu vitwatira vilii vyatuviwoniti na kuvipikinira.”<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Su, awa wazewi wa shyotera motu waberiziya kwa kukaripa nentu, shakapanu wawalekeziyiti. Waweza ndiri kuwapanana azabu toziya wantu woseri waweriti wankumkwisa Mlungu toziya ya shitwatira ashi. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Muntu ayu yawamponiziyiti kaweriti na umli wa vinja nentu ya malongu msheshi <verse eid="ACT 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Pawawalekeziyiti hera, Peteru na Yohani wawuyiti kwa wayawu, wawagambira galii gawagambiritwi na watambika wakulu wa Shikundi sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu na wazewi. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Nawomberi pawapikaniriti shisoweru ashi waweriti pamwera mukumluwa Mlungu wankutakula, “Mtuwa, gwenga ndo mnyawa gwa mpindi na pasipanu, ibahali na vyoseri vyamlamu! <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Gwenga gumtenditi ntumintumi gwaku, tati gwetu Dawudi, katakuli kwa likakala lya Rohu Mnanagala, Kwa shishi maisi ganamaya? Iwera hashi wantu watenda mipangu ya hera? <verse eid="ACT 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Wafalumi wa pasipanu walituliti kala, na watuwa waliwoniti pamwera, watenda ntambu imonga kwa Mtuwa na watenda ntambu imonga kwa Kristu gwakuwi.” <verse eid="ACT 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />“Mana, nakaka, ndo Herodi, Pontiwu Pilatu, wantu wa Israeli na wantu wa maisi pawariwoniti palaa panu mlushi, kumkoma Yesu ntumintumi gwakuwi Mnanagala mweni kamsyaguliti. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Waliwoniti su watendi vitwatira vilii vyagufiriti na kupanga kwanjira kwanja kwa uwezu waku na mafiliru gaku <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Kumbiti vinu, gwee Mtuwa, gulori vitiriziwu vyawu. Gutuwezeshi twenga wantumintumi waku kushibwera shisoweru shaku kwa ugangamala. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Gunyoshi liwoku lyaku su guponiziyi wantu. Gutendi lilangaliru na mauzauza kwa litawu lya Yesu ntumintumi gwaku Mnanagala.” <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Pawamaliriti kumluwa Mlungu pahala palii pawaliwoniti, nawomberi woseri wamemiziyitwi Rohu Mnanagala. Woseri wanja kubwera shisoweru sha Mlungu pota lyoga. Walikaliti gambira mlongu yumu <verse eid="ACT 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Shipinga shoseri shawamjimiriti Yesu waweriti na moyu gumu na Rohu yimu. Kwahera ata yumu yakaweriti na shintu shoseri kashitula shiweri lunda yakuwi mweni, ila wagawaniti vyoseri vyawaweriti navyu. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Wantumintumi watakuliti kwa likakala livuwa kuzyuka kwa Mtuwa Yesu, na yomberi Mlungu kawapanana tekelera zivuwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Kwahera muntu yoseri yakapungukiwitwi shintu, mana waweriti na malambu ama numba waweriti wankuviwuza <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />na kuwapanana ntumintumi mpiya azi, wawayupa kila yumu shiyasi shakafira <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />kuweriti na Mlawi yumu, mwiwuka gwa Kupiru, litawu lyakuwi Yosefu, ulaa wantumintumi wamshemiti Barinaba mana yakuwi, “Muntu yakapanana moyu”. <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Yomberi viraa kaweriti na lirambu lyakuwi, kawuziti, katola mpiya zilii kawapanana wantumintumi.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">1 Uzyanga wa Ananiya na Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Muntu yumu yawamshema Ananiya na mdala gwakuwi Safira wawuziti lirambu lyawu viravi. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Kumbiti, mdala gwakuwi pakawera kavimana, Ananiya kalitulila seemu ya mpiya zyakazipatiti na seemu imonga ilii kawayupiti wantumintumi. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Su, Peteru kamkosiyiti, “Ananiya, mbona shetani kingira mmoyu mwaku na kukutenda gumzyangi Rohu Mnanagala kwa kulitulira seemu ya mpiya zagupatiti kulawilirana na lilambu lilii? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Pamberi pa kuliwuza liweriti lyaku na paguliwuziti kala, isigala mpiya azi ziweriti zaku guzitumii ntambu yagufira. Toziya gaa, gwamuwiti mmoyu mwaku kutenda shitwatira sha ntambu ayi? Gumzyanga ndiri muntu, Gumzyanga Mlungu!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananiya, pakapikaniriti aga kaguwa pasi, kahowa.Wantu woseri wapikiniriti shisoweru sha lilawiru ali watiriti nentu. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Wandemba wasoka, wayigibikira njimba yakuwi, wamlaviya kunja, wamsira. <verse eid="ACT 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Pa shaka sha masaa matatu hangu, mdala gwakuwi, pota kuvimana shitwatira shilawiriti, kingira mngati amu. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Peteru kamgambira, “Gung'ambiri! Hashi, shiyasi ashi sha mpiya ndo shampatiti kwa kuwuza lirambu lilii?” Yomberi kankula, “Yina, ndo sheni ashi”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Yomberi Peteru kamgambira, “Mbona mtenda mpangu kumjera Rohu gwa Mtuwa? Gupikiniri! Walii wantu wagenditi kumusira mpalu gwaku, vinu wapanu paligomi na wankukutola gwenga viraa.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Vumu Safila kaguwa kulongolu kwa magulu ga Peteru, kahowa. Wandemba walii pawingiriti, wamwoniti kahowa kala, hangu wamlaviya kunja, wamsira pakwegera na mpalu gwakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Shipinga shoseri sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu pamuhera na woseri yawapikaniriti shisoweru sha vitwatira avi, watiriti nentu.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumintumi wankutenda mauzauza gavuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Wantumintumi watenditi mauzauza na makangashu gavuwa pakati pa wantu. Wawumini waweriti wankuliwona pamwera muukumbi wa Selemani. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Muntu yoseri gwingi yakaweriti ndiri muumini kajeriti ndiri kuwera pamhera na womberi. Ata hangu, wantu wamonga yawawera ndiri na njimiru ayi wawazyuma. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Walanga ya wantu yawamjimiriti Mtuwa, wapalu na wadala, iyongerekiti. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Toziya ayi, wantu waweriti wankuwajega walweli mnjira na kuwagonjeka pampindi pa shitanda na mikeka su Peteru pakapita, tembera shivuni shakuwi shiwashinkuli wamu wawu. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Wantu wavuwa wasokiti kulawa mulushi za kumbekumbeku za Yerusalemu, wankuwajega walweli wawu na walii yawawera na shamshera wadoda na womberi woseri waponiziwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumintumi wankubeziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Shakapanu mtambika mkulu na wayaguwi yawaweriti pamuhera na shipinga sha Masadukayu, wawera na weya. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Su, wawatawa ntumintumi, na kuwajega mngati mnumba nkulu ya shibetubetu. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Kumbiti pashiru ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa kayivuguliti magomi ya shibetubetu, kawalaviya kunja, kawagambira, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Mgendi mkagoloki Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu na kuwagambira wantu kila shintu kuusu makaliru aga gasyayi.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Wantumintumi wajimiriti, wingira Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu mandawira putiputi, wanja kufunda. Mtambika mkulu na wayaguwi pawasokiti, washemiti mkutanu gwa shiyotera motu shikulu, ndo shipinga sha wazewi wa Wayawudi, shakapanu wawatuma wantu mushibetubetu wawajegi wantumintumi walii. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Kumbiti wakulu awa pawasokiti aku wawawona ndiri mshibetubetu mlii. Hangu wawuyiti, wawagambira mumkutanu,<verse eid="ACT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />Pawatakula, “Tuwoniti shibetubetu shitatwa kila uwega na walolera wankulolera magomi. Kumbiti patuvuguliti tumwona ndiri muntu yoseri mngati.”<verse eid="ACT 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Mkulu gwa walolera wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu na watambika wakulu pawapikaniriti shisoweru ashi wawera na lyoga, wavimana ndiri gawawapatiti. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Kiza muntu yumu, kawagambira, “wantu walii yamuwatatiriti mshibetubetu, vinu wamunumba nkulu ya Mlungu, wankufunda wantu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Panu mkulu gwa walolera wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu pamwera na wantu wakuwi wagenditi mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, kawajega. Kumbiti wawakamula ndiri kwa likakala, toziya watiriti handa wantu mewawagumi mabuwi.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Su wawajega, wawagolisiya kulongolu kushiyotera motu , Mtambika Mkulu kawagambira, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Tuwaberiti paweru kufunda kwa litawu lya muntu ayu, vinu mweneza mafunda genu poseri Muyerusalemu na mupanga kututulira lawama ya kuhowa kwa muntu ayu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Panu Peteru, kiwiti pamwera na walii ntumintumi wamonga, kankula, “Mpaka tumjimiri Mlungu, muntu ndiri. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Mlungu gwa mbuyi gwetu kamzyukisiyiti Yesu pa mwenga kumlaga kwa kumpingika mlupingika. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Ayu ndomweni ulii yakakwisitwi na Mlungu mpaka uwega wakuwi wa mliwu, kawera mlongoziya na Mlopoziya su katendi wantu wa Israeli waleki vidoda, wapati kulekiziwa vidoda vyawu. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Twenga ndo wakapitawu wa lilawiru ali, yomberi Rohu Mnanagala ndo yomberi Mlungu kawayupa walii wawamjimira, wankupitaulira vira lilawiru ali.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Wajumbi woseri wa shizyunga shilii pawapikaniriti aga, waweriti na maya, ata waamuwa kuwalaga. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Kumbiti Mfalisayu yumu yawamshema Gamalieli mweni kaweriti mfunda gwa Malagaliru na yakapananitwi ligoya nentu kulongolu kwa wantu woseri, kagolokiti kulongolu kushiyotera motu kulii, kafiriti ntumintumi walii walaviwi kunja katepu. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Shakapanu kawagambira wajumbi walii wa shiyotera motu , “Walushi lwa Israeli, shondi pamberi pa kutenda ashi shamfira kuwatenda wantu awa! <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Makashu shididini, kulawiriti muntu yumu litawu lyakuwi Teuda, kalitakulira kuwera muntu gwa mana na wantu pakwegera na miya mhanu walijegiti pamhera na yomberi, kumbiti wamlagiti, shakapanu wandundami wakuwi woseri wapalanganika na shipinga shakuwi shifuwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Kayi, shakapanu, shaka shilii sha kuwalangwa wantu, kalawiriti Yuda gwa Galilaya. Ayu na yomberi kwawakwegiti wantu wamfata, Kumbiti na yomberi wamlagiti, na wandundami wakuwi wapalanganikiti. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Na vinu viraa neni nuwagambira kotukuwatendera shintu shoseri wantu awa, muwalekiziyi! Toziya, payiwera shitendu ashi shawu shanjishwa na muntu, hashiwuki sheni. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Kumbiti handa shanjishwa na Mlungu, hera ndiri handa hapeni muwezi kuwakanga, su hamliwoni mmulema Mlungu.”<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Su, wajimilirana na yomberi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Su wawashema ntumintumi walii, waamuwa wasyatagwi viboku na kuwaberiziya nawafunda kayi kwa litawu lya Yesu, shakapanu wawaleka wagendi zawu. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Su, ntumintumi walawa kunja kushiyotera motu pawamema nemeru, toziya wafiruwiti kusoniziwa kwajili ya litawu lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu na ukaya kwa wantu, womberi wendereyiti kila lishaka kufunda na kubwera Shisoweru Shiwagira sha Yesu kuwera ndo Kristu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Watangatila saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Pamberi, walanga ya wafundwa paweriti iyongerekiti, kulawiriti magugumiru pakati pa walongu yawayoweriti Shigiriki na walii yawayoweriti Shiebraniya. Walii yawayoweriti Shigiriki wagugumiliti handa wakenja wawu waweriti wankuwalyaluwa pakati ubagulira wa mafiru ga kila lishaka. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Hangu, wafundwa lilongu na mbili washemiti shipinga shoseri sha wafundwa, walonga, “iherepa ndiri twenga tuleki kushibwera shisoweru sha Mlungu su tugolokeri ubagulira wa nfiru. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Hangu, walongu wetu, msyaguli muwamu wenu wantu saba wana zyuma iherepa, wamemitwi na Rohu na wana luhala, na twenga hatuwapanani lihengu ali. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Twenga, kumbiti, hatushuguliki na sala na lihengu lya kubwera shisoweru sha Mlungu.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Shitwatira ashi shiherepa kwa shipinga shoseri. Wawasagula stefanu, muntu yakawera na njimiru nkulu na kumema Rohu Mnanagala, Filipi na Prokoru na Nikanori na Timoni na Parimena na Nikolayi muntu gwa Antiokiya yomberi kwanja kaweriti mudini ya Shiyawudi. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Wawatula kulongolu kwa ntumintumi, nawomberi wawaluwira na kuwatulira mawoku.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Shisoweru sha Mlungu shiziditi kweneya na walanga ya wafundwa aku Yerusalemu iyongerekiti nentu, na shipinga shikulu sha watambika wa numba ya Mlungu waiyanka njimiru.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Stefani wamtula mlikakala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Mlungu kamupananiti Stefanu manemu gavuwa, kampanana likakala livuwa ata kawera kankutenda mauzauza na makangashu pakati pa wantu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Kumbiti wantu tunga walawira su walikakatali na Stefanu. Wantu wamu awa waweriti wa numba ya Mlungu yimu yaishemwa “Numba ya Mlungu ya wantu lekeru.” Nawomberi walawira Kureni na Alekizandiriya, wamonga walawira Kilikiya na Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Kumbiti wasinditi kumkanga toziya ya luhala lwakuwi na toziya ya ulii Rohu yakamlongoziyiti shaka pakatakuliti. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Hangu wawahongiti wantu wamu watakuli, “tumpikinira Stefani pakatakula shisoweru sha kumwigira Musa na kumwigira Mlungu.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Ntambu ayi, wasonguziyiti wantu, wazewi na wafunda wa malagaliru. Su, wamwizira Stefani, wambata na kumjega kulongolu Kushiyotera motu shikulu. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Wajegiti Pashiyotera motu wakapitawu wa mpaya weni watakuliti, “Muntu ayu kaleka ndiri kupayigira pahala panu pananagala na malagaliru ga Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Toziya tumpikiniriti kala pakatakula eti Yesu ayu gwa Nazareti hakapahalibisii nakamu pahala panu na kuwusilira kutali ntambu zilii zyatwangiti kulawa kwa Musa.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Woseri yawaweriti mushikawu sha Shizyungu wamloliti dii Stefani, washiwona sheni shakuwi handa ntumintumi gwa kumpindi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">1 Utuba ya Stefani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Su Mtambika Mkulu kamkosiya, “Hashi, shitwatira ashi shanakaka?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Yomberi Stefani katakula, “Mwalongu wangu na ashina tati, mpikanireni! Mlungu gwa ukwisa kamlawiriti tati gwetu Aburahamu pakaweriti kulii Misopotamiya pamberi kenigendi kulikala kulii Harani. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Mlungu kamgambiriti, ‘Guwuki paisi yaku, guwaleki wantu wa lukolu lwaku, Gugendi paisi hanukulanguziyi!’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Hangu, Aburahamu kahamiti isi ya Kalidayu, kagenda kulikala Harani. Pakahowiti kala tati gwakuwi, Mlungu kamwusiyiti kayi Halani kiza kulikala paisi ayi yamlikala vinu. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Mlungu kamupiti ndiri ata seemu yimu ya isi ayi iweri yakuwi, ata hangu, kamlagiliti kumpanana isi ayi iweri yakuwi na ya walelwa wakuwi, tembera shaka ashi kaweriti ndiri na mwananguta. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Mlungu kamgambiriti hangu, ‘Walelwa waku hawajegwi paisi yayikolwa mlima na wantu wamonga, na aku hawatendwi wamanda na kutenderwa vidoda kwa shaka sha vinja miya msheshi. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Kumbiti neni hanuwatozi wantu yawagenda kuwatenda kuwera wamanda. Mlungu kalonga, shakapanu hanuwalaviyi muisi ayi su wizi kunguwira pahala panu.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Shakapanu Mlungu kayitenda jandu iweri langaliru lya lipatanu. Hangu, Aburahamu kamyingiziyiti jandu mwana gwakuwi Isaka lishaka lya nane pakayiwukiti kala. Na Isaka, ntambu irayi, kamyingiziyiti jandu Yakobu. Yomberi Yakobu kawatendiriti walii wambuyi ligumba na wawiri ntambu irayi.”<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Wambuyi walii wamwoniriti weya Yosefu, wamwuza muumanda Misri. Kumbiti Mlungu kaweriti pamwera nayomberi. <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />Kamuwusiya mutabu zakuwi zoseri. Mlungu kampanana ntambu na luhala kulongolu kwa Farawu, mfalumi gwa Misri, ata Falawu kumtula kaweri mkulu gwa isi ilii na numba ya shifalumi. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Shakapanu, kwaniti njala ngulu paisi yoseri ya Misri na Kanaani, isababisha kuperuwa kukulu. Wambuyi wetu wapata ndiri shiboga shoseri <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Su, Yakobu pakapatiti visoweru handa aku Misri kuweriti na viboga, kawatumiti wana wakuwi, yani wambuyi wetu, wagendi aku Misri mala ya kwanja <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Pamwanja gwawu gwa pili, Yosefu kalimaniziyiti kwa walongu wakuwi, na Farawu kaimaniti kaya ya Yosefu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Yosefu katumiti ujumbi kwa tati gwakuwi Yakobu na walongu woseri, wantu sabini na wamuhanu, wayizi Misri. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Hangu, Yakobu kagenditi Misri kweni yomberi na wambuyi wetu wamonga wahowiti. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Njimba zyawu wazijegiti mpaka Shekemu, yankusirwa palipumba Aburahamu lyakahemiriti kulawa kwa likabira lya Hamoli kwa shiasi tunga sha mpiya. <verse eid="ACT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Shaka pashitimiyiti Mlungu kalitenda lagilu lyakampananiti Aburahamu, walanga ya wantu kulii Misri iyongerekiti kala na iweriti nkulu nentu.<verse eid="ACT 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />“Upeleru, mfalumi yumu yomberi kammana ndiri Yosefu kanjiti kukolamlima aku Misri. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Kawatabisiyiti wantu wetu na kawatenderiti udoda wambuyi wetu pakawalagalira wawayasili kunja wananguta wawu wadidini su wahowi. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Musa kayiwukiti shaka ashi na kaweriti mwana kaherepa nentu. Yomberi kaleritwi mukaya ya tati gwakuwi kwa shaka sha myezi mitatu, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />na pawamlaviyiti kunja, binti gwa Farawu kamtoliti, kamlera gambira mwana gwakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Musa kafundwa vitwatira vyoseri vya luhala lwa Wamisri kamanika kwa visoweru na manyawiru.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Pakaweriti na umli wa vinja malongu msheshi kaamuwiti kugenda kuwawona walongu wakuwi Waisraeli.”<verse eid="ACT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />“Aku kamwoniti yumu gwawu kankumtendera vidoda, kagenda kumlopola na kwa kuwuzilira, kamlaga Mmisri ulii. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Kalisheriti handa Waisraeli wayaguwi mewavimani handa Mlungu kamtumiti yomberi kuwalopola, kumbiti kavimana ndiri hangu. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Shilawu yakuwi, kawoniti Waisraeli wawili wankulikoma, kajeriti kuwakolaniziya mawoku pakalonga, Mwenga ndo mwawalongu, iwera hashi mwankulitenderana vidoda maweni kwa maweni <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Ulii yakaweriti kankumkoma myaguwi kamkankiti Musa kumpeku kalonga, ndo gaa yakakutuliti gwenga guweri mtuwa na mkolaniziya mawoku gwetu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Hashi, gufira kunaga handa ntambu yagumlagiti Mmisri ulii lishu? <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Pa kupikinira aga, Musa katugiti, kagenda kulivaga paisi ya Midiyani na aku kapata wana wawili.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Vinja malongu msheshi pavitimiyiti, ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa kamlawiriti Musa pashitogolu shiweriti shankuyaka motu kushiwala kulii pakwegera na lugongu Sinayi. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Musa kalikangasha nentu kuwona shitwatira ashi ata kasegelera pakwera su kasunguliri, kumbiti kapikiniriti liziwu lya Mtuwa, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />Neni ndo Mlungu gwa mbuyi gwaku, Mlungu gwa Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobu! Musa kalendemera kwa lyoga na pota kujera kulola nentu. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Mtuwa kamgambira, Guyopoli vilwatu vyaku mana panu pagugoloka ndo pahala pananagala. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Nugawona madoda gawawatendera wantu wangu kulii Misri. Mpikanira shiwembu shawu, naneni niza kuwalopola. Su vinu, hanukutumi Misri.”<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Musa ayu ndo ulii wantu wa Israeli yawamlemiti pawatakuliti, Ndo gaa yakakutuliti gwenga guweri mkolamlima na mwamuliru gwetu? Ndomweni yakajegitwi na Mlungu kaweri mkulu na mlopoziya, kwa liwoku lya ulii ntumintumi gwa kumpindi yakamlawiriti mushiputira shashiweriti shankuyaka motu. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Ndo yakawalongoziyiti wantu walii walawi Misri kwa kutenda mauzauza na makangashu paisi ya Misri, pabahali ya Shamu na kushiwala kwa shaka vinja malongu msheshi. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Musa ndo yakawagambiriti wantu wa Israeli, Mlungu hakawasyagulirani mbuyi handa neni kulawa pawalongu wenu mwenga maweni. <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Ayu ndo ulii yakaweriti mulijojiniru aku kushiwara pamuhera na watati wetu na ntumintumi gwa kumpindi ulii yakatakuliti na yomberi pamuhera na watati wetu mulugongu lwa Sinayi, na yomberi kawankiti visoweru vyaviwera na ukomu su katupanani twenga. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Kumbiti yomberi ndo mbuyi gwetu yakalemiti kumpikinira, wamkangiti kumpeku, wana lwamatamata lwa kuwuya Misri. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Wamgambiriti Aruni, gutunyawiri milungu yayitulongoziya munjira, toziya tuvimana ndiri yagampatiti Musa yakatulongoziyiti kulawa Misri! <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Su shiweriti shaka womberi wanyawiti shinyagu sha mwana gwa ng'ombi. Womberi washilaviliriti tambiku na waviniti msambu kwa kuvipanana ligoya kwa vilii vyawavinyawiti kwa mawoku gawu. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Kumbiti Mlungu kawukiti pakati pawu, kawaleka waviguwiri vintu vya kumpindi kwa Mlungu, ntambu yailembitwi mushintola sha wambuyi wa Mlungu, ‘Mwenga wantu wa Israeli! Hashi, neni ndiri yamundaviliriti tambiku na malaviwu kwa shaka sha vinja malongu msheshi kulii kushiwala? <verse eid="ACT 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Mwenga mshinyasuliti shisasa sha mlungu Moleki, na shinyagu sha ndondu mlungu gwenu Refani. Shinyagu shamshinyawiti ndo shamshiguwiriti. Toziya ayi hanuwajegi lopola kutali kupitira Babiloni!’”<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Kushiwala kulii wambuyi wetu waweriti na lihema liii lilipitawuliti kuwera kwa Mlungu. Lyalinyawitwi handa Mlungu ntambu yakamgambiriti Musa kalinyawi, nakala kamili ya shiraa shakalanguziyitwi. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Shakapanu wambuyi wetu waliyangiti womberi kwa womberi mpaka shaka sha Yoshuwa, pawainyasuliti isi ilii kulawa kwa maisi geni Mlungu kagawingiti kuulongolu kwawu. Panu lilikaliti mpaka shaka sha Dawudi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Dawudi kawupatiti upendelewu kwa Mlungu, kamluwa Mlungu kamlekeziyi su kamnyawiri pahala pa kulikala, ulii yakaweriti Mlungu gwa Yakobu. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Kumbiti Selemani ndo yakamnyawiriti numba Mlungu.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Ata hangu, Mlungu mkulu hakatami ndiri munumba zijegitwi na muntu, mbuyi ntambu yakatakula,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Mtuwa kalonga, kumpindi ndo shibanta shangu sha ufalumi na pasipanu ndo pahala pangu pa kutulira magulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Mtuwa kalonga, “Hashi mwenga hamunyawili numba ya ntambu gaa?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Ama pahala paneni pakwoyera hapaweri koshi? <verse eid="ACT 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Hashi, mawoku gangu ndiri yaganyawiti vintu vyoseri avi?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Mwenga makaidi wakulu! Myoyu na makutu genu ndo handa ga wantu wa maisi. Mwenga handa wambuyi wetu. Mashaka goseri mwankumlema Rohu Mnanagala. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Hashi, kwana mbuyi yoseri gwa Mlungu, wambuyi wenu wawatabisiya ndiri? Wawalagiti walii yawatungiti kwiza kwakuwi yakamfiriziya Mlungu. Na vinu, mwenga mumgalambuka na mumlaga. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Mwenga muliyangiti lilagaliru ilii lijegitwi kwamwenga na wantumintumi wa kumpindi, kumbiti mnjimira ndiri.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stefani kankulangwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Wazewi walii wa shiyotera motu pawapikiniriti aga, wakalaliti nentu, wamsagira menu kwa maya. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Kumbiti Stefani kaweriti kamemitwi na Rohu Mnanagala, kalola kumpindi kwa Mlungu, kawona ukwisa wa Mlungu na Yesu kalivaga uwega wa kumliwu wa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Katakula, “Mloleni! Mona kumpindi kuyoposolekwa na Mwana gwa muntu kagoloka uwega wa kumliwu wa Mlungu.” <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Panu, wantu woseri mushikawu shiraa sha shiyotera motu wabotanga umatu na kuziba makutu gawu kwa mawoku gawu. Shakapanu wamkopokela woseri pamwera, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />wamlaviya kunja kulushi, wamguma mabuwi. Walii wakapitawu wagatula mahabiti gawu pasi pa ulolera wa mntemba yumu litawu lyakuwi Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Wendereyiti kumguma kwa mabuwi Stefanu aku pakawera kankumluwa Mlungu, “Mtuwa Yesu, guwanki rohu yangu!” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Kasuntama, kalira kwa liziwu likulu, “Mtuwa, nagushihola shidoda ashi kwawomberi.” Pakatakuliti hangu, kahowa. Sauli nayomberi kashiwoniti shitendu ashi sha kumlaga.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="s">Numba ya Mlungu inkwanja kubeziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Sauli kashiwoniti shitendu ashi sha kumlaga Stefanu kuwera shiherepa. Lishaka ali shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu aku Yerusalemu lyanjiti kutabisiwa nakamu. Wantu woseri yawamjimira Kristu, paiwera ndiri hera wantumintumi walii, walazimikiti kugenda aku na aku na kweneya museemu zya malambu ga Yudeya na Samariya. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Wantu yawamguwira mlungu wamsiriti Stefanu na wamtenderiti madaya makulu.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Kumbiti Sauli kashiharabisiya shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu. Kingira kila numba na kuwakamula wapalu na wadala na kuwatula mushibetubetu.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakiristu wankubwera Injili Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Walii wapalanganikiti wagenda aku na aku wankulibwelera shisoweru. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipi kasuluka kingira lushi lwa Samariya, kawabwelera kuusu Kristu. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Na makutanu kwa nfiru yimu wapikinira visoweru vira vyakatakuliti na Filipi pawapikaniriti na kulola mauzauza gakagatenditi. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Washamshera wadoda wawalawa wantu wavuwa pawagutanga, wantu wavuwa yawalewelekiti na vibyeketu, woseri waponiziwitwi. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Iweri sekuseku ngulu pakati palushi lulii<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Muntu yumu, litawu lyakuwi Simoni, kaweriti pakanyawa uhawi pakati palushi palii, pakawakangasha wantu wa maisi ga Wasamariya, pakatakula paweru yomberi ndo muntu mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Woseri wampikanira kwanjira mdidini ata mkulu, pawatakula, Muntu ayu ndo likakala lya Mlungu yakashemwa, likakala likulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Wampikanira toziya kawakangashira kwa uhawi wakuwi kwa shaka shitali. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Kumbiti pawamjimiriti Filipi, pakabwera visoweru viwagira vya ufalumi wa Mlungu, na litawu lyakuwi Yesu Kristu, wabatiziwa, wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Na yomberi Simoni mweni kajimiriti kubatizwa, walikola na Filipi, kalikangasha pakagawoniti makangashu na mauzauza makulu gagatendikiti.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Wantumintumi yawaweriti Yerusalemu, pawapikaniriti kuwera Samariya washijimira Shisoweru sha Mlungu, womberi wawatumiti Peteru na Yohani, <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Womberi pawasokiti, wawaluwira wamwanki Rohu Mnanagala. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Kwa mana badu hakeniwasulukiri ata yumu gwawu, ila wabatiziwa hera kwa litawu lyakuwi Mtuwa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Watula mawoku gawu panani pawu, nawomberi wamyanga Rohu Mnanagala<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simoni pakawoniti kuwera wantu wankupananwa Rohu Mnanagala kwa kutulilwa mawoku ga wantumintumi, yomberi kafiruwiti kuwapanana mpiya pakalonga, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />Mmpanani neni uwezu awu, su kila muntu yanfira kumtulira mawoku gangu, kawanki Rohu Mnanagala.<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Kumbiti Peteru kamwankula, gwagamiri kutali na mpiya zyaku toziya gulihola handa guweza kuhemera lifupu lya Mlungu kwa mpiya. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Gwahera shifungu wala gwahera seemu pakati pashitwatira ashi, Toziya moyu gwaku guherepa ndiri kulongolu kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Su, guleki madoda gaku aga, gukamluwi Mtuwa, na yomberi kaweza kukulekeziya maholu gaku aga. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Kwa mana nukuwona handa gumema weya nentu na gwa mtatilwa gwa vidoda.<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simoni kankula, pakatakula, munduwili mwenga kwa Mtuwa, nashiza kumpata shoseri pakati pa aga gamtakuliti.<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Peteru na Yohani pawabweriti kala kuusu Mtuwa, wawuya Yerusalemu. Wabweriti shisoweru shiwagira pakati pavijiji vya Samariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipu na afisa gwa Esiopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa katakula na Filipi, kamgambira, Guwuki ugendi ouwega wa kusika ata njira ilii yailawa Yerusalemu kugenda Gaza, njira ayi ipita kushiwala. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Nayomberi kawuka, kagenda, shaka shirashi kuweriti na Mwisiopiya yumu, towashi, mweni kaweriti kamumwanja kugenda ukaya. Muntu ayu kaweriti mkolamlima kamanika gwa luhanja lwa Kandaki, malikiya gwa Esiyopiya. Kaweriti kagenda aku Yerusalemu kuguwira na shaka ashi kaweriti kankuwuya pakawera kakwena mbutuka ya kunika. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Pakaweriti kammwanja, kaweriti kankushibetula shintola sha mbuyi gwa Mlungu Isaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Rohu kamgambira Filipi, Gusegeleri pakwegera na mbutuka ayi, gulikoliri nayi. <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Su Filipu kagenda mbiru, kampikanira kankubetula mushintora sha Isaya mbuyi gwa Mlungu. Filipi kamkosiyiti, “Hashi, gugamana aga gagubetula?” <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Yomberi kamwankuliti, “Hanwezi hashi kugamana pota muntu gwa kuntakulira?” Shakapanu yomberi kamluwiti Filipu kakweni na kulivaga pamuhera na yomberi mumbutuka. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Na shifungu sha Malembu Mananagala gakaweriti kankugabetula ndo aga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">“Kaaweriti gambira kondolu yakajegwa kulikitulwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">Kaweriti gambira mwana kondolu yakapogolewa mibaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">mweni kalaviyiti ndiri liziwu hata kidogu.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Wamtendiriti lidufiya na kumwima haki yakuwi. Kwahera yakaweza kutakula kuwusu shiyuwuku shakuwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Toziya makaliru gakuwi gawusiwa pasipanu.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Ofisa ulii kamwankula Filipu, katakula, nukuluwa, mbuyi ayu, katakula visoweru avi kwa visoweru vya gaa, ndo visoweru vyakuwi mweni ama vya muntu mmonga <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Filipu kanjiti kutakula, kanjiti kwa Malembu Mananagala galaa aga, kamgambiriti yomberi Shisoweru Shiwagira sha Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Pawaweriti wankali wakwendereya na mwanja, wasokiti pahala pana mashi, na afisa ulii katakula, “pahala panu pana mashi, kwana shoseri sha kunewelera nambatizwa?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipu katakula, Pagujimira kwa moyu gwaku goseri, iwezikana. Kankula, kalonga, njimira handa Yesu Kristu ndo Mwana gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Kaamuli mbutuka ilii igoloki, wasuluka woseri wawili mmashi, Filipi na towashi ulii, nayomberi kambatiza.<verse eid="ACT 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Shakapanu, pawakweniti kulawa mmashi, Rohu gwa Mtuwa kamnyasula Filipi, towashi ulii hapani kamwoni kayi, su kagenditi zakuwi kasekuseku.<verse eid="ACT 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Kumbiti Filipi kawonikana pakati pa Azotu, na pakaweriti pakapita pakabwera shisoweru shiwagira pakati palushi yoseri, ata kingira Kayisariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Kuongoka kwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Kumbiti Sauli, kazidi kutisha na kulihola kuwahowiziya wafundwa wa Mtuwa, kamgendera Mtambika Mkulu gwa Numba Ngulu ya Mlungu, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />na mawankulu ga luhamba lwa kumaniziya kugenda kwa numba ya Mlungu kulii Dameski, su pakawona wantu wa njira ayi, wapalu kwa wadala, kawatawi na kuwajega Yerusalemu.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Kumbiti pakaweriti mnjira pakwegera kusoka Dameski, vumu gulangala koseri kulawa kuliyera. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Kaguwa pasi, na kapikanira liziwu lyakumgambira, “Sauli, Sauli! Iwera hashi guntabisiya?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Yomberi Sauli kakosiya, “Ndo gaa gwenga Mtuwa?” Nayomberi kamwankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">“Neni Yesu, mweni gwenga gumbeziyiti,” Liziwu lilonga. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />“Kumbiti gugoloki na gugendi gwingiri mlushi na aku hagugambilwi shagufiruwa kutenda.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Wantu walii yawaweriti wamwanja pamuhera na Sauli wagolokiti palii, waweriti wahera lya kutakula, wapikiniriti lilii liziwu kumbiti wamwona ndiri muntu. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sauli kagolokiti, na pakatumuliti masu gakuwi, kumbiti hakeniwoni shintu shoseri, wantu walii wamlongolera kwa kumkola liwoku mpaka lushi lwa Dameski. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Sauli kalivagiti mashaka matatu pota kulola, na shaka ashi kaliyiti ndiri ama kulanda shoseri.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Su, aku Dameski kuweriti na mfundwa yumu yawamshema Ananiya. Mtuwa kamgambira mawonu, “Ananiya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Yomberi kamwankula, “Na panu, Mtuwa”.<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Mtuwa kamgambira, Gugoloki, gugendi kwana njira yayishemwa longulongu, munumba ya Yuda gumkosiyi muntu kulawa Tarisu yawamshema Sauli, vinu kankuluwa, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />na mumawonu kawona muntu wamshema Ananiya kingira munumba na kumtulira mawoku su kapati kulola kayi. <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananiya kankula, “Mtuwa, mpikanira shisoweru sha muntu ayu kulawa kwa wantu wavuwa, mpikanira kuusu madoda gakawatendiriti wantu waku aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Na kiza panu kaweri na utuwa kulawa kwa Watambika Wakulu kuwatula mlikakala woseri yawalishemera litawu lyakuwi.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Kumbiti mtuwa kamgambira Ananiya, “Gugendi hera, toziya numsyagula kaweri shombu shaneni, kalibweri litawu lyangu kwa maisi na wafalumi wawu kwa wantu wa Israeli.”<verse eid="ACT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />“Neni namweni hanumlagiziyi gavuwa kwa ntambu ya litawu lyangu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Su, Ananiya kagenda kingira mnumba. Shakapanu katula mawoku gakuwi pampindi pa Sauli, katakula, “Mlongu Sauli, Mtuwa Yesu, yakakulawiriti paweriti mnjira kankwiza panu, kanduma neni su gupati kulola kayi na kumemiziwa Rohu Mnanagala.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Mala, vintu gambira mabaku gatuluka kulawa mmasu mwa Sauli, na kaweza kulola kayi. Kagolokiti na kubatizwa, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />na pa kuliya shiboga, likakala lyakuwi limwuyira.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli aku Dameski na Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli katamiti mashaka madidini pamuhera na wafundwa aku Dameski. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Mala kanjiti kubwera pakati pa numba ya Mlungu handa Yesu ndo Mwana gwa Mlungu.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Wantu woseri wampikiniriti walikangasha, watakula, “Hashi, muntu ayu ndo ulaulii yakawahoziyiti walii waweriti wankuluwa kwa litawu ali kulii Yerusalemu? Kayi kiziti panu kaweriti na nfiru ya kuwatula mlikakala wantu hawa na kuwajega kwa Watambika Wakulu!”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Ata vinu Sauli kazidi kupata makakala, na kwa ntambu handa Yesu ndomweni Kristu, Wayawudi wa aku Dameski wapalanganikiti nakamu.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Pa mashaka gavuwa gapititi. Wayawudi wajojinikiti na kutenda mpangu gwa kumlaga Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Kumbiti Sauli kapatiti shisoweru sha mpangu hagu. Paliwala na pashiru waloliriti magomi gwa kwingira mlushi lulii wapati kumlaga. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Kumbiti shaka sha pashiru wafundwa wakuwi wamtoliti, wamsulusiya pasi mnumba kwa lijamanda likulu kwa kupitira lupenyu lwaluweriti mshibambaza.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kankuwuya Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Sauli pakasokiti Yerusalemu kajeriti kuliwunga na walii wafundwa. Kumbiti woseri wamtiriti, waweziti ndiri kujimira handa yomberi kaweriti ntumintumi. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Kumbiti Barinaba kiziti kumtola Sauli, kamjega kwa wantumintumi na kawagambira ntambu Sauli pakamwoniti Mtuwa munjira, na ntambu Mtuwa pakayoweriti nayomberi. Kawagambiriti viraa ntambu Sauli pakaweriti kankubwera kwa litawu lya Yesu pota lyoga Dameski kulii. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Su, Sauli kalivaga pamuhera na womberi katyangira Yerusalemu yoseri kankubwera shisoweru sha Mtuwa pota lyoga. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Vilaa kayowiriti na kukakatala na Wayawudi wawatakula Shigiriki, kumbiti womberi wajeriti kumlaga. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Walongu walii pawayambuliti shitwatira ashi, wamtoliti Sauli, wamjega Kayisariya, wamleka kagendi zakuwi Tarisu.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Shakapanu shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu, shiweriti na ponga poseri Muyudeya na Galilaya na Samariya. Shitulitwi makakala na shyendereyiti kulikala mukumguwira Mtuwa na kupananwa moyu na Rohu Mnanagala, mawalangu ga shipinga ashi shyongerikiti.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteru kafikiti Lida na Jopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Peteru pakaweriti mwanja kila pahala kasokiti viraa kwa wantu wa Mlungu yawaweriti walivaga Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Haku kamwoniti muntu yumu yawamshema Aineya ndomweni kwa shaka sha vinja vinane kaweriti kagonja mshitanda toziya kaweriti kuleweleka. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Peteru kamgambira, Aineya, “Yesu Kristu kakuponiziya, Guyumuki gutandiki shitanda shaku.” Su Aineya kayumuka. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Wenikaya woseri wa Lida na Sharoni wamwoniti Aineya, na woseri wamwuyira Mtuwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dorika kaponiziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Kuweriti na mfundwa yumu mdala, mlushi lwa Yopa, wamshema Tabita kwa Shigiriki ndo Dorikasi mana yakuwi, mbawala. Mdala ayu kaweriti kankutenda viheri na kuwatanga wahushu. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Shaka ashi payiwera handa kalwala, na kuhowa. Wantu wayigulula nshimba yakuwi, wayigonjeka mushumba mgolofa. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Yopa patali ndiri na Lida, wafundwa pawapikaniriti handa Peteru kaweriti Lida, watuma wantu wawiri kwakuwi na ujumbi, “Gwizi kwatwenga kanongola.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Su, Peteru kagenda pamuhera nawomberi. Pakasokiti kajegitwi mgolofa ilii mushumba. Aku wakenja wavuwa wamtindira Peteru wankulira na kumlanguziya makoti na nguwu ndozyeni Dorikasi kaweriti kankuzinyawa shaka pakaweriti mkomu. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Peteru kawalaviyiti kunja woseri, kasuntama, kamluwa Mlungu. Shakapanu kayigalambukira ira nshimba ya ulii yakahowiti, kalonga, “Tabita, Gyumuki.” Nayomberi katumula masu gakuwi, <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Peteru kamtanga kugoloka, shakapanu kawashema wantu walii wa Mlungu na walii wakenja, kawayupa pakawera mkomu. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Shisoweru sha shitwatira ashi shivuwiti kila pahala aku Yopa, na wantu wavuwa wamjimira Mtuwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Peteru kalivagiti mashaka gamu aku Yopa, katama kwa muntu yumu mnyawa gwa lukuli yawamshema Simoni.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Peteru na Korineliwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Kuweriti na muntu yumu aku Kayisariya wamshema Korineliwu, jemidali gwa shikosi shimu shawashishema, “Shikosi sha Italiya.” <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Kaweriti muntu muheri, yomberi pamuhera na kaya yakuwi yoseri yawamfatiti Mlungu, kaweriti kankutenda gavuwa kuwatanga wahushu wa Shiyawudi na kaweriti kankumluwa Mlungu nentu. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Paweriti saa tisa paliwala, kawoniti nakaka ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mlungu kingira mngati na kumgambira, “Korineliwu!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />“Kamkwenjulira masu lahoka ayu kwa lyoga, kamgambira, Kwana shishi, mtuwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Lihoka ayu kamgambira, “Mlungu kaziyanga sala na vijungu vyaku kwa wahushu wala hapeni kaliwaluwi. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Vinu guwatumi wantu Yopa wakamshemi muntu yumu wamshema Simoni, kwa litawu lyamonga Peteru. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Yomberi muhenga munumba mwa mnyawa gwa lukuli wamshema Simoni, yakalikala pakwegera na litanda.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Pakatakuliti aga, ntumintumi gwa kumpindi ulii kawuka, Korineliwu kawashemiti wandundami wawili wa numba na yumu gwa wanjagila wakuwi kaweriti kamguwira Mlungu, <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />kamgambiziya goseri yagalawiriti, na kawatuma Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Shirawu yakuwi, wantu watatu pawaweriti wankali mumwanja na pakwegera kwingira Yopa, Peteru kakweniti pampindi pa shitwiku sha numba iweriti saa sita paliwala su kamluwa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Kiwiti na njala nentu na kafiriti kuliya shiboga, shiboga pashiweriti shankutandilwa, kalota. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Kawoniti mpindi zivungulwa na shintu handa lishuka likulu lisulusiwa pasi liweriti likolelwa wega zyakuwi msheshi. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Kuweriti na kila ntambu zya vigongolu, njoka na wambongu. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Kapikanira liziwu limgambira, “Peteru, gwimuki gulikituli, guliyi!” <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Kumbiti Peteru kankula, “ndala, Mtuwa, neni ndawalira ndiri shoseri shana uhumba na shifa ndiri kuliya”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Liziwu lilii lipikanika kayi limgambira, “Naguvishema vihumba viboga, Mlungu kavipunga!” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Shitwatira ashi shitendikiti mala ntatu shakapanu lishuka lilii liwuziwa kunani kumpindi.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Peteru pakaweriti kankulikangasha kuusu mana ya maonu aga yagaweriti kagawona, wantu walii wawatumitwi na Korineliwu, pawayambuliti kala njira ya kugenda kunumba ya Simoni, wasokiti paligomi gwa libambaza, <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Na wakosiya, “handa kwana mhenga amu yawamshema Simoni Peteru.” <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Peteru kaweriti kankali kankulihola kuvimana kuusu maonu, na panu Rohu kamgambira, “kwana wantu wankukusakula. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Gusuluki kanongola na pota naguwera na lyoga kugenda pamuhera nawomberi kwa mana ndo neni yanuwatumiti.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Su, Peteru kasuluka pasi, kawagambira wantu walii, “Neni ndo yamnsakula. Mwizira shishi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Womberi wamwankula, “Mnjagira Korineliwu mweni ndo muntu mheri, mguwira Mlungu na kagohereka pawulongolu pa Wayawudi woseri, katutuma. Kagambirwa na ntumintumi gwa kumpindi mnanagala kakushemera ukaya kwakuwi su kapikaniri shisoweru shaguweri nashu sha kutakula.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Peteru kawashemera mnumba, kawapanana pakugonja pashiru palii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Shirawu yakuwi, Peteru kanja mwanja pamuhera nawomberi, na wamonga wa walongu wa Yopa aku walikoliti nayomberi. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Lishaka lyalifatiti wayingiriti Kayisariya na aku Korineliwu kaweriti kankuwahepera pamuhera na walongu na waganja yakaweriti kawashemera. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Peteru pakaweriti kankuyingira, Korineliwu kalawiti kunja kumwanka, kasuntamala makukama pawulongolu pakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Kumbiti Peteru kamgolosiya, kamgabira, “Gugoloki, kwa mana neni ndo muntu hera.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Peteru kingira mnumba, pawaweriti kala wankuyowera na Korineliwu, wantu wavuwa waliwoniti amu. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Peteru kawagambira, “Mwenga muvimana handa Myawudi yoseri kabelwa na malagaliru gakuwi ga dini kuwera pamuhera na wantu wa maisi gamonga. Kumbiti Mlungu kang'ambira hapeni numholeri muntu yoseri kiwa mhumba awu kadoda. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Na shaka pagumtumiti kwa neni, niziti pota kulema, nuwakosiyani, su kwa shishi gumtuma kwa neni.” <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Korineliwu kalonga, “Mashaka matatu gapititi saa gambira ayi, saa tisa paliwala, neni panweriti nankumluwa Mlungu mnumba mwangu. Vumu, muntu yakaweriti kavala nguwu zing'ereng'eta kagolokiti kulongolu kwa neni, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Katakula, ‘Korineliwu! Mlungu kapikanira kuluwa kwaku na tambuku yaku kwa wahushu. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Gumtumi muntu Yopa kakamshemi muntu yawamshema Simoni Peteru, kwa litawu lyamonga Peteru, kawukaya kwa Simoni mnyawa gwa lukuli, yakalikala pakwegera na litanda.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Hangu nukutumiriti ujumbi pota kushelewa, nagwenga gutenda viheri kwiza. Vinu, twenga twapawulongolu pa Mlungu, kupikinira kila shintu Mtuwa kankutugambira.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwera kwa Peteru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Panu Peteru kanja kutakula, “Vinu nuvimana handa nakaka Mlungu kahera upendelewu. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Muntu yoseri yakamguwira Mlungu na kutenda yagamfiriziya Mlungu hakaweri gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Awu ndo ujumbi ulii Mlungu yakawujegiti kwa wantu wa Israeli, pakabwera Shisoweru Shiwagira shashijega ponga kwa njira ya Yesu Kristu, yomberi ndo Mtuwa gwa woseri. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Mwenga muvimana shitwatira shashilawiriti muisi yoseri ya Yudeya kwanjira Galilaya pa ubatizu ulii yakawubweriti Yohani. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Muvimana Yesu gwa Nazareti na ntambu yakamsyaguliti kwa kummiminira Rohu Mnanagala na likakala. Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera nayomberi, yomberi kagenditi aku na aku pakatenda maheri na kuwaponiziya woseri yawaweriti wayingilwa na Mkondola, toziya Mlungu kaweriti na yomberi.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />“Twenga ndo wapitawu wa vitwatira vyoseri vyakatenditi muisi ya Wayawudi na Muyerusalemu. Wamlagiti mlupingika. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Kumbiti Mlungu kamzyukisiyiti lishaka lya tatu, kamtenda kawoniki, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />wamwoniti wantu woseri ndiri, ira kwa walii Mlungu yakawasyaguliti kala waweri makapitawu wakuwi, yani twenga yatuliyiti na kulanda pamuhera nayomberi pakazyuka kala kulawa kwawahowiti. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Katugambiriti tubweri Visoweru viwagira kwa wantu woseri na kuwona handa yomberi ndo yakasyaguritwi na Mlungu kaweri Mtoza gwa yawawera wakomu na wahowiti. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Wambuyi woseri wayoweriti kuusu yomberi handa kila muntu yakamjimira hakamlekiziyi vidoda vyakuwi vyoseri kwa litawu lyakuwi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi wankumwanka Rohu Mnanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Shaka Peteru pakaweriti kangali kankutakula visoweru avi, Rohu Mnanagala kawasulukiriti woseri wawaweriti wankupikanira ujumbi awu. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Wayawudi walii yawasokiti pamuhera na Peteru, walikangashiti kuwona Mlungu ntambu yakawamiminiriti shirupa sha Rohu Mnanagala wantu yawaweriti ndiri wayawudi, <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />mana yawapikaniriti pawayowera kwa likabira lihenga na pawamkwisa Mlungu. Peteru kalonga, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Wantu awa wawamyanga Rohu Mnanagala gambira twenga ntambu yatumyangiti. Hashi, kwana yoseri yakaweza kuwalewelera kubatizwa kwa mashi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Su, kawagambira wabatizwi kwa litawu lya Yesu Kristu. Shakapanu wamluwa kalikali nawomberi kwa mashaka madidini.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Peteru kankulilanguziya mushipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu, Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Wantumintumi na walongu yawalikaliti Yudeya kulii wapikiniriti kuwera wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi viraa washiwankiti shisoweru sha Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Shaka Peteru pakawuyiti Yerusalemu, walii wawayingiriti jandu, walikakatala na yomberi, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />“Gwenga gugenda kulikala na wantu wangali kwingiziwa jandu na ata guliya pamuhera nawomberi! <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Panu Peteru kawagambira shinaga ubaga kuusu galii gagatendikiti tangu kwanjira.”<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Lishaka limu nweriti nankuluwa Mlungu mlushi Lwa Yopa, moniti mawonu, moniti shintu gambira lishuka likulu lyankusuluka pasi kulawa kumpindi liweriti likolwa pembi zyakuwi msheshi, litulwa pambwega pangu. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nzunguliriti mngati nweri mona vigongolu wana magulu msheshi, wavigongolu wa mushitogolu, wag'ongolu wawakwawa na wambongu wa kuliyera. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Shakapanu mbikanira liziwu lyangung'ambira, ‘Peteru gwimuki, gulagi na guliyi!’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Kumbiti neni pandakula, ‘ndala, Mtuwa! Mana shoseri shashiwera shihumba ama shidoda asheni yingiri mumlomu mwaneni.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Liziwu lipikanika kayi kulawa kumpindi, ‘naguvishema vihumba vintu Mlungu vyakavipungiti.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Shitwatira ashi shitendikiti mala ndatu, na upeleru wakuwi viwusiwa kugenda kumpindi. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Katepu hera, wantu watatu wawaweriti wawalagalira kwaneni kulawa Kayisariya wayingiriti kunumba kwanweriti nankulikala, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pahweriti, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malembu gamonga gana </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kwawaweriti.</char></note> wankulikala. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Rohu kang'ambiriti ng'endi pamuhera nawomberi pota kutira. Walongu sita awa walikoliti pamuhera naneni, twingira mnumba ya muntu ulii. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Yomberi katugambiriti ntambu yakaweriti kamwona ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kagoloka ukaya kwakuwi na kumgambira, ‘Gumtumi muntu Yopa kakamshemi muntu yumu yawamshema Simoni Peteru. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Yomberi hakakugambiri ujumbi weni haukulopoziyi gwenga na kaya yaku yoseri.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Na pakanyanjiti kuyowera hera, Rohu Mnanagala kawasulukiriti gambira ntambu yakatusulukiriti twenga palii pakwanjira. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Panu nuliholiti visoweru vilii Mtuwa ntambu yakatakuriti, ‘Yohani kabatiziti kwa mashi, kumbiti mwenga hamubatizwi kwa Rohu Mnanagala.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Su, handa Mlungu kawapanana viraa wantu wa maisi gamonga shirupa shirashilii shakatupiti twenga patumjimiriti Mtuwa Yesu Kristu, hashi, neni ndo gaa ata panjera kumubera Mlungu!” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Pawapikaniriti aga, walekiti likakatala, wamkwisa Mlungu pawalonga, “Mlungu kawapanana wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi lupenyu lwa kuleka vidoda wapati ukomu!”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu, Antiyokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Kulawilirana na ndabiku yairawiliti shaka Stefanu pawamlagiti, wawumini wapalasiwitwi. Wamonga wagenditi mpaka Foiniki, Kupiru na Antiokiya pawabwera ujumbi ulii kwa Wayawudi hera. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Kumbiti wamonga wa wantu yawamjimiriti Yesu yawalawiti Kupiru na Kureni, wagenditi Antiokiya pawawubwera ujumbi kwa wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi, pawashibwera Shisoweru Shiwagira kuusu Mtuwa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Mtuwa kawatangiti na wantu wavuwa wajimiriti na kumgalambukira Mtuwa.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Shisoweru sha shitwatira ashi shipikanirika kwa shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu aku Yerusalemu. Hangu wamtuma Barinaba kagendi Antiokiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Pakasokiti aku na kuwona Mlungu ntambu yakawatekeleriti wantu, kanemeleriti na kawahimiziya woseri walikali muwuwaminika wawu kwa Mtuwa kwa Moyu gwawu goseri. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Barinaba kaweriti muntu muheri na kamemiti Rohu Mnanagala na njimiru, likundi likulu lya wantu likwegitwi kwa Mtuwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Shakapanu, Barinaba kagenditi Tarisu kumsakula Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Pakamwoniti, kamjega Antiokiya. Nawomberi woseri wawili walikala mushipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu kwa shinja shoseri pawafunda shipinga shikulu sha wantu. Antiokiya aku, ndo kwa mala ya kwanja, wafundwa washemitwi wantu yawamjimira Kristu.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Shaka shiraa shirii, wambuyi wa Mlungu wiziti Antiokiya kulawa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Yumu gwawu wamshema Agabu kagolokiti, na kwa makakala ga Rohu katungiti handa hakuweri na njala ngulu muisi yoseri. Njala ayi ilawiriti shaka sha ukola mlima wa Klawudi. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Wafundwa walii waamuwiti kila yumu kwa ntambu ya uwezu wakuwi kajegi shoseri su kuwatangitira walongu walii wawaweriti wankulikala Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Watenda hangu, shakapanu, na kuwapanana mpiya wazewi wa Ludewa lwa Barinaba na Sauli.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu, shankutabisiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Pakwegera shaka shiraa shilii, mfalumi Herodi kanjiti kuwatabisiya wantu wamu yawamjimira Kristu. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Kamlagiti kwa ligumba Yakobu, mlongu gwakuwi Yohani. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Pakawoniti handa shiweri shitendu ashi shiwafiriziyiti Wayawudi, kendeleyiti, kamubata Peteru. Ashi shitendikiti shaka sha msambu gwa libumunda lyangali kutulwa simika. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Pamberi pakumkamla, Peteru katatilwa mshibetubetu, katulwa pasi pa mlolera gwa vipinga vyamsheshi vya wanjagila wamsheshi wamsheshi. Herodi kafiriti kumtula paweru pagupititi msambu gwa Pasaka. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Su, Peteru pakaweriti mushibetubetu, kumbiti wantu wa shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu waweriti wankumluwira kwa Mlungu.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kankumlaviya Peteru mushibetubetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Pashiru pamberi pa lishaka lilii lyeni Herodi hakamlaviyi Peteru paweru, Peteru kaweriti kagonja pakati pa wanjagila wawili wawili. Kaweriti kayopwa minyololu miwili, na walolera waweriti wankulolera ligomi gwa shibetubetu. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Vumu, ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa kagoloka pakwegera nayomberi na uweru ulangala mshumba mshibetubetu. Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamshinkula Peteru mluwavu kamyumusiya pakatakula, “Guwuki kanongola!” Kamukamu minyololu ilii yayitawitwi mmawoku idumuka na ituluka pasi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Shakapanu ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamgambira, “Gulitawi mshipi gwaku, guvali vilwatu vyaku.” Peteru Katenda hangu. Shakapanu Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi ayu kamgambira, “Guvali likoti lyaku, gunfati.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Peteru kamfata kunja kumbiti kavimana ndiri handa aga gagatenditwi na ntumintumi gwa kumpindi ayu gaweriti ga nakaka, kalihola kaweriti kankulota mumbota. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Wapititi shituwu sha kwanja sha kulolilera na sha pili, shakapanu wasoka kuligomi gwa kwingilira mlushi. Hangu ligomi guwavugukira, nawomberi walawa kunja. Waweriti wankugendagenda munjira yimu su ntumintumi gwa kumpindi ulii kamleka Peteru.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Panu Peteru ndo kavimaniti yagalawiriti, katakula, “Vinu nuvimana nakaka handa Mtuwa kamtuma ntumintumi gwakuwi gwa kumpindi kanopoziyi mumawoku mwa Herodi na kulawa muvitwatira vilii vyoseri Wayawudi watumbiriti galawili.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Pakavimaniti hangu kagenditi kanongola mpaka ukaya kwa Mariya mawu gwakuwi Yohani Mariku, Amu wantu wavuwa waweriti wajojinika pawaluwa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Peteru kapiga hodi kuligomi gwa kunja, na ntundami yumu litawu lyakuwi Roda kagenda kuligomi kwitikira. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Mhinja kalimaniti liziwu lya Peteru kanemelera nentu, Mhinja ulii kawuya utuga bila kuvugula Mlyangu na kuwagambira handa Peteru kaweriti kagoloka kunja kuligomi . <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Wamgambira mhinja ulii, “Gwana lukwali!” Kumbiti yomberi kakazaniyiti handa iweriti nakaka. Nawomberi wamgambira, “Ayu ndo ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwakuwi.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Shaka ashi Peteru kaweriti kendeleyiti kupiga hodi. Upeleru wavugula ligomi , wamwona, walikangasha. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Peteru kawapungira liwoku walikali jiii, na kawagambira Mtuwa ntambu yakamlaviyiti mshibetubetu. Kawagambira walaviyi shisoweru sha shitwatira ashi kwa Yakobu na walii walongu wamonga, shakapanu kalawa kagenda pahala pingikayi.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Pawushiyiti, lilawiriti lyoga likulu pakati pa wanjagila walii kuusu yagaweriti gamlawiriti Peteru. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Herodi kaamuwiti wagutendi msaku kumbiti waweza ndiri kumpata. Hangu kaamuwiti wanjagila walii wawakosiyi, kalagalira wawalagi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Shakapanu kalawa aku Yudeya, kagenda Kayisariya kalikaliti kweni aku.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Herodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Herodi kakalaziwitwi nentu na wantu wa Tiru na Sidoni. Kumbiti womberi wamjegiriti ujumbi. Nawomberi wafawulu kwanja kumpata Bilastu kaweri uwega wawomberi. Bilastu kaweriti mgolokera mkulu gwa ikulu ya mfalumi. Shakapanu, kamgendera Herodi wamluwa kuweri na ponga, kwa mana isi yawu ilitumbiriti isi ya mfalumi kwa shiboga.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Lishaka limu lyalisyagulitwi, Herodi kaweriti kavala nguwu lasimi na kulivaga mushiti sha mfalumi, na kawabweliriti wantu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />“Ali ndo liziwu lya Mlungu, lya muntu ndiri.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Pala panu ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa kamgusiya Herodi pasi toziya kampanana ndiri Mlungu nzyumi azi. Wamliya wasangu, kahowa. <verse eid="ACT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Shisoweru sha Mlungu shizidi kweneya na kukula.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Pa Barinaba na Sauli kujimira utenderu wawu, walawiti kayi Yerusalemu, wamtola Yohani yawamshema viraa Mariku.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Barinaba na Sauli wankusagulwa na kutumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mushipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu aku Antiokiya kuweriti na wantu wamonga yawaweriti wambuyi wa Mlungu na wafunda, muwamu kaweriti Barinaba, na Simoni yawamshema viraa Nigeri, na Lukiu gwa Kureni, Sauli na Manaeni ndo yomberi kaleritwi pamuhera na mfalumi Herodi. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Pawaweriti wankutenda ibada yawu kwa Mtuwa na koya kuliya, Rohu Mnanagala katakula, “Gunzyaguliri Barinaba na Sauli toziya ya lihengu lyanuwashemiriti.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Su, pawaluwiti Mlungu kala na koya kuliya, wawatulira mawoku, wawaleka wagendi zawu.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushisiwa sha Kupiru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Barinaba na Sauli pawatumitwi kala na Rohu Mnanagala, wasulukiti mpaka Selewukiya, na kulawa aku wakweniti mtubwi mpaka shisiwa sha Kupiru. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Pawasokiti Salami wabweriti shisoweru sha Mlungu munumba za Wayawudi za kuluwira Mlungu, kwaniti Yohani Mariku pamuhera na womberi kutanga lihengu.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Wagendigenditi kulawa uwega wumu wa shisiwa mpaka Pafu, uwega wa pili, na aku wamwoniti mhawi yumu mbuyi gwa mpayu Myawudi yawamshema Baliyesu ndo kalipayiriti kawera mbuyi gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Kaweriti ganja gwa mkolamlima gwa shisiwa Serigiu Paulu, ndo yomberi kaweriti muntu mheri nentu. Serigiwu Paulu kawashemiti Barinaba na Sauli su kapikaniri shisoweru sha Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Kumbiti ayu muhawi Elima, handa ntambu yakaweriti kashemwa kwa Shigiriki, kajeriti kuwaberibeziya su kumlewelera mkulu gwa shisiwa nakiza kugalambukira njimiru ya shikristu. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Su, Sauli kamanikana kwa litawu lwa Paulu, pakawera kamema Rohu Mnanagala, kamkwenjulira masu mhawi ayu, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />Na kalonga, “Gwenga! Gwenga mwana gwa Mkondola! Gwenga gwa mngondu gwa shoseri shilii shashimfiriziya Mlungu, goya ndiri ata mala yimu kujera kuzipotiziya njira za Mtuwa zyazinyoshikiti. <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Vinu, liwoku lwa Mtuwa halikukomi, haguweri na lwisi na hapeni guwezi kuwona uweru wa mshenji kwa shaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Katepu Elima masu gakuwi gadunuka kanja kugenda aku na aku pakasakula muntu gwa kumkola liwoku kamlonguziyi. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Mkola mlima ulii pakawoniti yagalawiriti, kajimiriti, kalikangashiti nentu mafundu gakapikiniriti kuusu Mtuwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mu Antiyokiya na Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Kulawa Pafu, Paulu na wayaguwi wagenda nyanyi mpaka Periga Mupamfiliya, kumbiti Yohani Mariku kawalekiti, kawuya Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Wanja kulawa Periga wasoka Antiokiya na Pisidiya, na Lishaka lya kwoyera wingiriti munumba ya Mlungu, walivaga. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Pawasomiti kala mushintola sha malagaliru ga Musa na mmalembu ga wambuyi, wakulu wa numba ya Mlungu wawajegiriti ujumbi awu, Walongu handa, mwanashi shitwatira sha kuwagambira wantu su waweri na moyu muwagambiri. <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Su, Paulu kagolokiti, kawapungira liwoku, kanja kulonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Wanalushi wa Israeli na Wayawudi ndiri yamwamuguwira Mlungu, mpikinilireni! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Mlungu gwa wantu wa Israeli kawasyaguliti wambuyi wetu na kuwatenda waweri lushi lukulu pawaweriti wahenga Misri kulii. Mlungu kawalaviyiti aku kwa likakala likulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Kawahepeleriti kwa shaka sha vinja malongu msheshi kushiwala. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Kagaharibisiyiti maisi saba ga isi ya Kanaani kawayupa wantu wakuwi awa isi iweri yawu. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Vinja mia msheshi na magumba muhanu gapititi, shakapanu kawapananiti watoza wawalongoziyi mpaka shaka sha mbuyi gwa Mlungu Samweli. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Panu wafiriti waweri na mfalumi na Mlungu kawayupa Sauli, mwananguta gwa Kishi gwa likabila lya Benjamini, kaweriti mfalumi gwawu kwa shaka sha vinja malongu mhanu. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Pawamwusiyiti kala Sauli, Mlungu kumsaguliti Dawudi kaweri Mtuwa gwawu. Mlungu kalaviyiti shibali shakuwi kwakuwi pakalonga, ‘Numwoniti Dawudi mwananguta gwa Yese, muntu gwanumfira neni, muntu mweni hakatendi goseri galii nganfira kugatenda.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Kulawa mushiyiwuku sha muntu ayu, Mlungu kawajegera Waisraeli Mlopoziya mweni ndo Yesu ntambu yakalagiliti. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Pamberi pa Yesu kwanja lihengu lyakuwi, Yohani kawabweliriti wantu woseri wa Israeli handa mpaka waleki vidoda na wabatizwi. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Yohani pakaweriti kankumalira ujumbi wakuwi kawagambiriti wantu, ‘Mlihola neni na gaa? Neni ndiri ulii yamumlolera. Mpikiniri! Ayu kamkwiza pa neni na neni nfiruwa ndiri ata kuziyopola ngoyi za vilwatu vyakuwi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Walongu, mwenga wamwera wananguta wa lukolu lwa Aburahamu, na woseri wawawera Wayawudi ndiri wamwamguwira Mlungu! Ujumbi awu wa ulopoziya ujegwa kwa twenga. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Toziya wenikaya wa Yerusalemu na wakulu wawu wammana ndiri weri mlopoziya, wala wavimana ndiri visoweru vya wambuyi wa Mlungu vyawabetula kila lishaka lya kwoyera. Ata hangu, wavitenditi visoweru vya wambuyi vitimii kwa kumtoza Yesu kuhowa. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Toziya wampatandiri na likosa lifiruwa wamlagi, wamluwiti Pilatu kamtozi wamlagi. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Pawatenditi kala goseri gawalembiriti kuusu yomberi, wamsusiyiti kulawa mlupingika, wamtula mlipumba. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Kumbiti Mlungu kamzyukisiyiti kulawa kwahowiti. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Na kwa mashaka gavuwa kawalawiriti walii wawagenditi pamwera nayomberi kulawa Galilaya mpaka Yerusalemu. Awa ndo walii vinu makapitawu wakuwi kwa wantu wa Izraeli. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Na vinu Barinaba na neni twa panu kuwajegera mwenga Visoweru Viwagira. Lagilu la Mlungu kwa wambuyi wa twenga liwera nakaka mushaka shetu, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />kashitimiza vinu kwajili yatwenga wazukulu wawu kwa kumzyukisiya Yesu kulawa kwawahowiti. Handa ntambu yawalembiti muzaburi ya pili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Gwenga gwa mwana gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">Neni lelu nwera tati gwaku.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Na kwa kumzyukisiya kulawa kwawahowiti, hakenipati kayi kuwuya aku na kuwola, Mlungu katakuliti hangu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Hanukutekeleri tekeleru nanagala na yanakaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">Yanumwaiditi Dawudi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Yina, na Muzaburi zimonga kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Hapeni numuleki Mnanagala gwaku kawoli.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />“Dawudi mweni katimiziti mafiliru ga Mlungu shaka shakuwi, na shakapanu kahowa na kusilwa pakwegera na wazewi wakuwi, na nshimba yakuwi iwola. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Kumbiti ulii ndo Mlungu kamzyukisiyiti kulawa kwawahowiti hakenipati kuwola. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Su muvimani walongu wangu, kuwera kupitira Yesu Ujumbi wa kulekiziya vidoda ubweritwi kwa mwenga, <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />na kila yumu yakamjimira Yesu wamlekeziya vidoda vyoseri, shitwatira sheni hapeni shiwezikani kwa njira ya malagaliru ga Musa. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Mlilolireni su, namwiza kupatwa na galii yagatakulitwi na wambuyi, <verse eid="ACT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Mloreni, mwenga mwanazarawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Mlikangashi muhowi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Ndo shintu sheni hapeni mjimiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Ata handa muntu pakawagambirani hapeni mjimiri.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Paulu na Barinaba pawaweriti wankulawa mnumba ya Mlungu, wantu walii wawashemiti kayi lishaka lya kwoyera lyalifatiti, wayoweri nentu kuusu shitwatira ashi. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Kuliwona aku pakumalilikiti, Wayawudi wavuwa na wantu Wayawudi ndiri waweriti wingira dini ya Shiyawudi wawagendiriti Paulu na Barinaba. Wantumini awa wayoweriti nawa, wawatula moyu wendereyi kulikala walitumbiri manemu ga Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Lishaka lya kwoyera paliweriti pakwegera, kila muntu mulushi lulii kiziti kupikinira shisoweru sha Mtuwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Shaka Wayawudi pawaliwoniti lipinga wantu wamemiti weya, walema shakaweriti katakula Paulu na kumwigilanga. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Kumbiti, Paulu na Barinaba wayoweriti kwa ugangamala nentu, watakula, “iweriti ndo mpaka shisoweru sha Mlungu shiwayiziri mwenga huti, kumbiti mushirema na kuwona mfiruwa ndiri ukomu wa mashaka goseri, su, tuwalekani na kuwagendera wantu wawawera Wayawudi ndiri. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Toziya mtuwa katulagalira hangu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Nukutula gwenga guweri gulangala kwa wantu wawawera Wayawudi ndiri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">Su guwajegeri wantu ulopoziwu pasipanu paseri.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi pawapikaniriti vitwatira avi wanemeleriti, waukwisa ujumbi wa Mtuwa, na walii yawasyagulitwi kupata ukomu wa mashaka goseri, wawera wantu yawamjimira Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Shisoweru sha mtuwa shyeneya pahala poseri mumkowa gulii. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Kumbiti Wayawudi wawasongizira wadala wa shiwangu shikulu yawawera Wayawudi ndiri weni waweriti wamguwira Mlungu, na wapalu wamanikana wa lushi alu. Wayanja kuwabeza Paulu na Barinaba, wawawinga kulawa pahala pawu. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Su, wafundwa wapunda lidiku liweriti mumagulu gawu kuwera likalipiru, shakapanu wagenda ikoniu. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Wafundwa Muantiokiya waweriti wamema nemeleru na rohu munanagala.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Kulii Ikoniu, vitwatira viweriti handa vyaviweriti kulii Antiokiya, Paulu na Barinaba wagenditi munumba ya Mlungu gwa Shiyawudi wayowera kwa ugangamala ata Wayawudi wavuwa na Wagiriki wawera wajimira. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Kumbiti Wayawudi wamonga yawalemiti kuwera wawumini wasonguziya na kutula weya mmoyu mwa wantu yawawera wayawudi ndiri su wawakomi walongu awa. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Paulu na Barinaba wendereyiti kulikala aku kwa shaka shitali. Wayoweriti kwa ugangamala wa Mtuwa, na Mtuwa kalanguziya unakaka wa ujumbi yawaulaviyiti kwa manemu gakuwi, kwa kuwatenda watendi mauzauza na makangashu. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Wantu wa lushi walekanikiti, wamonga wawajimiriti Wayawudi na wamonga waweriti uwega wa wantumintumi.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Upeleru, wantu wamu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi, pamwera na wakulu wawu, wajumilirana kuwatendera vidoda ntumintumi awa na kuwagumanga mabuwi. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ntumintumi pawayambuliti shitwatira ashi, watugiriti Listira na Deribi, mlushi lya lukaoniya, na museemu za pakwegera, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />wawera wankubwera visoweru viwangira aku.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muulistra na Deribi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Kwaniti muntu yumu aku Listira mweni kaweriti shibyeketu gwa magulu kwanjira kwiwuka, na kaweriti hakenipati kugendagenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Muntu ayu kaweriti kankumpikinira Paulu pakaweriti kankubwera. Paulu kamloliti dii, na pakawoniti keniti njimiru ya kuweza kuponiziwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Kalonga kwa liziwu likulu, “Gugoloki gugendigendi kwa magulu gaku!” Muntu ulii kagoloka, kanja kukopokakopoka na kugendagenda pahala palii. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Lipinga lya wantu pawawoniti shakatenditi Paulu, wanjiti kubotanga kwa likabira lya Likaoniya, “Milungu watwizira gambira muntu na watwizira pasipanu!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Barinaba wamupa litawu zewu, na Paulu wamshema Herimesi, toziya yomberi ndo yakaweriti kankuyowera. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Na Mtambika gwa numba ya Zewu yayiweriti kunja kulushi kajega pongu na majenjeri ga mauwa kulongolu kuligomi mkulu gwa lushi, yomberi pamwera na lipinga lya wantu wafiriti kuwatambikira wantumintumi. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Barinaba na Paulu pawapatiti visoweru avi wapapuliti nguwu zawu na kutugira mulipinga lya wantu pawabota. <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />Walongu, kwa shishi mtenda vitwatira vya ntambu ayi? Twenga viraa twa wantu gambira mwenga. Na twa panu kuwabwelera Shisoweru Shiwagira, mpati kuvileka vinyagu avi, mumgalambukiri Mlungu yakawera mkomu Mlungu yakanyawiti kumpindi na pasipanu, lbahali na vyoseri vyaviweramu. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Makashu Mlungu kajimiriti kila Isi itendi ntambuyaifiriti. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Kumbiti, Mlungu hakenileki kulilanguziya kwa vitwatira viheri vyakawatendera, kawatowera vula irawa kuliyera, kawayupa vimeru kwa shaka shakuwi, kawayupa viboga na kuimemiziya myoyu yawu nemeru. <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Tembera watakula ntambu ayi Iweriti mbaka ndiri kuwalewelera wantu walii kotukuwatambikira. <verse eid="ACT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Wayawudi wamu wiziti kulawa Antiokiya na Ikoniu wawajega wantu pamwera nawomberi, wamgumi mabuwi Paulu na kumkwega mpaka kunja kulushi walongiti kahowa kala. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Kumbiti wafundwa pawajojinikiti na kumzyengeta kayumkiti kawuya mlushi. Shirawu yakuwi yomberi pamuhera na Barinaba wagenditi Deribi.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu na Barinaba wankuwuya Antiokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Pa Paulu na Barinaba kubwera visoweru viwagira aku Deribi na kuwapata wafundwa wavuwa, shakapanu wawuyiti Listira mpaka Ikoniu na Antiokiya Mupisidia. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Wawayongiliriti likakala wafundwa na kuwapanana moyu wasigali munjimiru, wawagambira, “Ndo mpaka twawoseri twenga kupitira mutabu zivuwa su twingiri Muufalumi wa Mlungu, wafunditi.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Wawasyaguliti wazewi mukila shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu, na kwa kuluwa na kwoya kuliya wawatula pasi pa ulolera wa Mtuwa yawamjimiriti kwa maluwa na kwoya kuliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Pawapititi kala muisi ya Pisidiya, wasokiti Pamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Aku wabweriti ujumbi Muperiga. Na shakapanu wagenditi Ataliya, <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Na kulawa aku wawuyiti salama Antiokiya, kweni shaka shipititi waweriti pasi pa ulolera wa manemu ga Mlungu kwa ajili ya lihengu lyeni vinu waweriti walimalira. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Pawasokiti Antiokiya, waliwoniti pamuhera na shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu na kuwagambira visoweru vya vitwatira vyoseri Mlungu vyakatenditi pamuhera na womberi, na ntambu yakawavuguliriti njira ya njimiru kwa wantu yawawera Wayawudi ndiri. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Walikaliti pamuhera na wafundwa walii kwa shaka shitali.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Kuliwona kuyerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Su, wantu wamu wasokiti Antiokiya kulawa Yudeya wanjiti kuwafunda walongu walii pawatakula, “Handa pamwingiziwa ndiri jandu kulawirana na Malagaliru Mlungu gakamupananiti Musa, hapeni mlopoziwi.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Shitwatira ashi shijegiti ukakatala mkulu, pa Paulu na Barinaba kulitakuziyana nawomberi, su womberi waamuwiti kuwera Paulu na Barinaba pamuhera na walongu wamu mushipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu aku Antiokiya, wagendi Yerusalemu kuwawona wantumintumi na wazewi kuusu shitwatira ashi. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu shilongiti kwahere, nawomberi pawaweriti wankupitira Foiniki na Samariya wawagambiriti wantu yawawera Wayawudi ndiri ntambu yawamgalambukiriti Mlungu. Shisoweru ashi shiwaherepeziya nentu walongu woseri awa. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Pawasokiti Yerusalemu wawankwa na shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu pamuhera na wantumintumi na wazewi yawatakuliti kila shintu Mlungu shakatenditi pamuhera nawomberi. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Kumbiti wajimira wamonga wawaweriti wa shipinga sha mafalisayu wagolokiti, pawatakula, “Ndo mpaka wantu wa maisi gamonga wayigiziwi jandu na kufundwa kugafata malagaliru ga Musa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Su wantumintumi na wazewi waliwoniti pamuhera kushilola weri shitwatira ashi. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Pawalitakuziyiti kwa shaka shitali, Peteru kagolokiti kalonga, “Mwalongu wangu, mwenga muvimana handa tangu kwanja Mlungu kafiriti kuzyagula neni muwamu mwamwenga nuwabweleri Shisoweru Shiwagira, wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi wapati kupikinira na kujimira. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Na Mlungu yakavimana moyu gwa wantu, kalanguziya handa kawajimira kwa kuwayupa nawomberi Rohu Mnanagala handa yakatuyupiti twenga. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Katubaguliti ndiri pakati petu na womberi, kayipungiti myoyu kwa njimiru. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Vinu su, kwa shishi kumjera Mlungu kwa kuwapapiziya wafundwa awa visanka vyeni pota wambuyi wetu, pota twenga tuweza ndiri kulitwika? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Ndala! Tujimiriti na tulopoziwitwi kwa njira ya manemu ga Mtuwa Yesu.” Twengapa handa womberi. <verse eid="ACT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Shikundi shoseri shitamiti jii pawampikinira Barinaba na Paulu wankutakulira mauzauza na makangashu geni Mlungu kagatenditi pakati pawu wantu wawawera ndiri Wayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Pawamaliriti kuyowera, Yakobu kanjiti kulonga, “Mwalongu wangu, mumpikaniri! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni katakuliriti Mlungu kwanjira kwanja ntambu yakalitendiriti na wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi, kasyagula wamonga wawu waweri wantu wakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Visoweru vya Wambuyi wa Mlungu vyateratera nakamu handa Malembu Mananagala ntambu yagalonga, <verse eid="ACT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />Mtuwa katakula, ‘Pa aga hambuyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">na kuuwuziya Ufalumi wa Dawudi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">hanyawi pahala pakuwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">na kupagangamaziya kayi. <verse eid="ACT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Na wantu woseri, wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi nuwashemiti waweri waneni hawizi kwaneni. <verse eid="ACT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Ndo ntambu yakatakula Mtuwa, yakatenditi shitwatira ashi kamanika kwanjira makashu.’<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />“Hangu neni amuwa ntambu ayi, aga nuwalagalirani kotukuyumbisiya wantu wawawera ndiri Wayawudi wawamgalambukira Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Su tuwajegerani luhamba kuwagambira nawaliya viboga vyawayingiziyiti mnumba kwa kutambikira vinyagu vya wamlungu, walituli gweka na uhumba, nawaliya shigongolu yoseri yawammindula sungu, nawalanda mwazi. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Malagaliru ga Musa gaweriti gabetulwa shaka shitali munumba ya Mlungu kila lishaka lya kwoyera, na visoweru vyakuwi wavibwera mukila lushi.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhamba kwa wawumini wawawera ndiri Wayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Shakapanu wantumintumi na Wazewi, pamuhera na shipinga shoseri sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu, waamuwiti kuwasyagula wantu wamu pakati pawu na kuwatuma wagendi Antiokiya pamuhera na Paulu na Barisaba. Wawasyaguliti Yuda yawamshemiti viraa Barinaba na yumonga yakashemitwi Sila, wantu wawili yawaweriti walongoziya pakati pa walongu. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Wawapananiti luhamba alu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">“Twenga wantumintumi na wazewi, walongu wenu, twankuwalamsiya mwenga wantu wa maisi gamonga wa aku Antiokiya na Siriya na Kilikiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Tupikanira kuwera wantu wamonga kulawa aku wawagaziya kwa visoweru vyawu, wayitula myoyu ya mwenga mulyoga. Kumbiti watenda hangu pota ya luusa yoseri kulawa kwatwenga. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Hangu, tuamuwa kuliwona pamwera kuwasyagula wantu wamu na kuwatuma kwamwenga pamwera na waganja wetu Barinaba na Paulu, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />weni wafiriti wagamizii ukomu wawu kwa ntambu ya lihengu lya Mtuwa gwetu Yesu Kristu. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Shakapanu tuwatuma Yuda na Sila kwamwenga, awa hawawagambirani weni aga gatugalembiti, <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Rohu munanagala na twenga tujimira kotukuwatwika visanka nentu ya vitwatira avi vya mana. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Namliya viboga vyawatambikiriti shinyagu, namlanda mwazi, namliya vinofu vya shigongolu yawamuminduliti na mlikali weri na uhumba. Muwera mtenda viheri handa pamshapira kutenda vitwatira avi. Mwakashina.” <verse eid="ACT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Wajumbi awa wawatumiti wasoka Antiokiya kweni wawashemiti wawumini waliwoni, wawayupa luhamba alu. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Pawasomiti Luhamba alu, visoweru vyakuwi viwayupiti moyu, wanemeleriti nentu. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yuda na Sila weni nawomberi waweriti wambuyi, wayoweriti na walongu awa kwa shaka shitali wankuwayupa moyu na kuwagagamaziya. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Pawatamiti aku kwa shaka tunga, walongu wa Antiokiya walonga kwaheri na kuwafilira ponga, shakapanu wawuya kwa wawatumiti walii. Malembu gamu gana shipandi ashi <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />kumbiti Sila kaamuwiti kusigala. <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Paulu na Barinaba wasigala Antiokiya kwa katepu, pawafunda na kubwera visoweru vya Mtuwa, pamwera na wantu wamonga watangala.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu na Barinaba wankulekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Pa mashaka gamu, Paulu kamgambiriti Barinaba, “Tuwuyi tukawatyangiri walongu walii mukila lushi patubweriti visoweru vya Mtuwa, tukaloli ntambu yawendereyiti.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Barinaba kafiriti wamtoli viraa Yohani yawamshema Mariku. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Kumbiti Paulu kafiriti ndiri kumtola mariku, mweni pamberi kawalekiti Pamfiliya kulii na kulema kuwera pamwera mulihengu lyawu. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Su, kulawira likakatala likulu pakati pawu, na walekana Barinaba kamtola Mariku, wakwena uwatu mkulu kugenda kupiru. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Nayomberi Paulu kamsyagula Sila, na pa walongu wa pahala panu kumtula pasi pa ulolera wa maheri ga Mtuwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Mumwanja agu kapitiriti Siriya na Kilikiya, pakavigangamaziya vipinga vya wantu yawamjimira Kristu,<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timotewu kapamwera na Paulu na Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Paulu kaziti Deribi na Listira, kweni katamiti mfundwa yumu yawamshema Timotewu. Mawu gwakuwi mweni vira kaweriti ntundami, kaweriti Myawudi, kumbiti tati gwakuwi kaweriti mgiriki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Timotewu kaweriti na nzyumi ngulu pakati pa walii walongu wa Listira na Ikoniu. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paulu kafiriti Timotewu kalikoli na yomberi mumwanja, hangu kamyingiziyiti jandu. Katenditi hangu toziya Wayawudi woseri watamiti seemu ayi wavimaniti handa tati gwakuwi Timotewu kaweriti Mgiriki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Pawaweriti wankuwuya mlushi zilii wawapananiti wantu malagaliru galii gagalaviyitwi na wantumintumi na wazewi kulii Yerusalemu, wawagambira wantu wagajimiri. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Su shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu shiziditi kugangamala munjimiru na shiyongerekiti nentu kila lishaka.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu kankuwona maonu Trowa kulii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Wawuyiriti Seemu za Firigiya na Galatiya toziya Rohu Mnanagala kawaluusu ndiri kubwera ujumbi awu kumkoa gwa Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Pawayiziti mumbaka zya Misiya, wajeriti kwingira kumkoa Bituniya, kumbiti Rohu gwa Yesu kawaluusu ndiri. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Su, wapitiriti Misiya, wagenda longulongu mpaka Trowa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Pashiru panu. Paulu kawoniti maonu geni kamwoniti muntu yumu gwa Makedoniya kagoloka palii na kumluwa, “Guloki, gwizi Makedoniya gwakatutangatiri.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Katepu pa Paulu kuwona maonu aga, tulitanditi kugenda Makedoniya pota kusherewa, tuwera na nakaka handa Mlungu katushema tuwabweleri shisoweru shiwagira.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludia kankumjimira Mtuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Kulawa Trowa, twamwanja longulongu mpaka Samotiraki na Shirawu yakuwi tusulusiya nanga Neopoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Kulawa aku, tugenditi mpaka Filipi, Lushi lya Wilaya ya kwanja ya Makedoniya, na weni viraa ndo Koloni lya Warumi. Tutamiti mulushi alu mashaka gamu. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Lishaka lya kwoyera tulawiti kunja ku Lushi, tugenda mmbeku ya lushemba lweni tulihola kuwera ndo pahala pa kuluwa Mlungu. Tulikaliti, tuyowera na wadala wajojinikiti pahala panu. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Muwamu wa walii yawatupikiniriti kaweriti mdala yumu mguwira Mlungu yawamshema Lidiya mwenikaya gwa Tuatira, mweni kaweriti kankuwuza nguwu za shitani za langi ya zambalawu. Mtuwa kavuguliti moyu gwakuwi ata kaviyanga visoweru vilii Paulu vyakaweriti katakula. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Shakapanu yomberi pamuhera na wantu wa numba yakuwi wabatizwa. Na yomberi katuluwa pakatakula, “Payiwera mjimira nakaka handa numjimira Mtuwa, mwizi ukaya kwaneni mlikali.” Katuhimiziya tugendi. <verse eid="ACT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Lishaka limu, patuweriti twankugenda pahali pa kuluwa Mlungu, mhinja yumu yakaweriti na wamshera wana likakala lwa kutunga kaliwoniti na twenga Mhinja ayu kaweriti kankuwapanana watuwa wakuwi mpiya zitangala kwa kutunga gwakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Su, muhinga ayu kamwiziriti Paulu na twenga, kabotanga na kutakula, “Wantu awa ndo wantumintumi wa Mlungu Mkulu. Wankuwabwelera njira ya ulopoziya.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Kaweri kankutenda hangu kwa mashaka gatangala ata lishaka limu Paulu kakalariti, kamgalambukira na kumgambira shamshera ayu, “Nukugambira kwa litawu lya Yesu Kristu, gumlawi ayu!” Palaa palii shamshera kamlawa. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Su watuwa wa muhinga ulii pawawoniti kuwera litumbiru lwawu lya kupata mpiya lipera, wawakamuliti Paulu na Sila, wawakwega mpaka paweru, kuulongolu kwa wakulu. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Wasitaki kwa watoza pawatakula, “wantu awa ndo Wayawudi na watenda fuju mulushi lwetu. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Wankufunda shitiba sheni twenga wenikaya wa Rumi tuluusiwa ndiri kushijimira pota kushifuta.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Shipinga sha wantu shingiriti na womberi, shiwakomanga. Na watoza walii wawavula nguwa zawu kwa likakala, wahimiziya wasyatangwi viboku. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Pakukomwa nentu watatirwa mnumba, na njagira gwa shibetubetu kahimiziwa kuwatula pasi pa ulolera mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Kulawirana na malagaliru aga, mnjagira ayu kawatuliti mushumba kati nakamu sha shibetubetu na kugatawa magulu gawu mushibawu. <verse eid="ACT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Pakakwegera na pashiru ligonu Paulu na Sila waweriti wankumluwa Mlungu na kuyimba lwimbu za kumzyuma Mlungu, aku watatirwa wamonga wawera wankupikanira. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Vumu, kulawiriti lilendemeru likulu lya litapaka libegiziya liyanjiru lya shibetubetu. Su, magomi yoseri ivuguka na minyololu yayiwatawiti watatirwa awa ilekana. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Mlolera gwa shibetubetu pakayumukiti na kuyiwona magomi ya shibetubetu ivugulwa, kaliholiti handa watatirwa woseri waweriti watoloka, na hangu kausomola ligumba wakuwi, kafiriti kulilaga. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Kumbiti Paulu kashema kwa liziwu likulu, “Kotukulitenda gwamweni toziya twenga twawoseri twa panu.” <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Pakamshemiti kala muntu kajegi limuliku, mnjagira gwa shibetubetu katugiriti mnumba, kaliyasa paulongolu pa magulu ga Paulu na Sila agawu kankulendemera kwa lyoga. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Shakapanu kawalonguziya kunja, kawakosiya, “Mwatuwa, ndendi shishi mbati kulopoziwa?” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Womberi wamwankula, “Gumjimiri Mtuwa Yesu na gwenga hagulopoziwi pamuhera na kaya yaku yoseri.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Su, wamubweleriti shisoweru sha Mtuwa yomberi pamhera na walongu wakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Mnjagira ulii kawatoliti saa iraa ilii ya pashiru kawagulula vironda vyawu, shakapanu yomberi na walongu wakuwi woseri kawabatiza pala palii. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Shakapanu kawatola Paula na Sila ukaya kwakuwi, kawayupa shiboga. Yomberi na walongu wakuwi woseri watenda shereku toziya vinu waweriti wamjimira Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Shirawu yakuwi mandawira, watoza wawatumiti maafisa wawu pawalonga, “muwavuguliri wantu walii.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Mjagira ulii gwa shibetubetu kamupananiti shisoweru Paulu, “Watoza watumiti ujumbi su mvugulilwi. Vinu muweza kulawa na kugenda zenu kwa ponga.” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Kumbiti Paulu kamwakuliti. “Eti shishi? Tembera tuweriti ndiri na likosa, watusyatangiti viboku paweru twenga ndo wana lushi wa Rumi. Kayi, watuyingiziyiti mnumba na vinu wafira kutuvugulira kwa bada! Ata padidini! Ndo mpaka weni wayizi panu watuvuguliri.” <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Maafisa awa wawagambiriti visoweru watoza kuusu shitwatira ashi, naomberi pawapikaniriti handa Paulu na Sila waweriti weni kaya wa Rumi, watiriti. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Hangu, wagenditi kuwaluwa na pawawalaviiti kala mnumba wawaluwiti wawuki mulushi lulii. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Paulu na Sila walawiti mushibetubetu, wagenditi ukaya kwa Lidiya. Aku waliwoniti na shipinga sha waumini na pawawagambiriti kala visoweru vya kuwayupa moyu wawuka.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Fuju Tesaloniki kulawirana na mabweru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Kwa kupitira Amfipoli na Apoloniya wagenditi mpaka Tesaloniki kweni kuweriti na numba ya Mlungu ya Wayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Paulu kingiriti nawomberi mnumba ya Mlungu ntambu yaiweriti shitiba shakuwi, kwa mashaka matatu ga kwoyera kalitakuziyana nawomberi kwa Malembu Mananagala. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Pakayoweriti na kulagiziya handa imubidi Kristu kutabika na kuzyuka kulawa kwawahowiti kawagambira, “Yesu mweni neni numubwera kwamwenga ndo Kristu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Wamu wawu wajimiliti wayingira na Paulu na Sila. Viravi, walanga ngulu ya Wagiriki wawamguwiriti Mlungu pamwera na wadala wavuwa wa ntambu ya kunani, wayingiriti naomberi. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Kumbiti Wayawudi wawona weya, wawatola wafizuli kusoku, watenda shipinga na kujega fuju kumjini koseri. Wayingira numba ya Yasoni watumbiriti kumpata amu Paulu na Sila su wawajegi paweru. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Kumbiti wawapata ndili na hangu wamkwegiti Yasoni pamwera na walongu wamonga mpaka kwa wakulu wa lushi, washowangana, “Wantu awa wawera wankupavuluga pasipanu poseri na vinu wa panu kumjini. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Yasoni kawashemera ukaya kwakuwi. Woseri wankutenda shigalambuku sha lagaliru lya Kayisari pawatakula eti, kwana mfalumi yumonga yawamshema Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Kwa visoweru avi wawatuliti lyoga wakulu wa kumjini na shipinga sha wantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Yawatenda Yasoni na wayaguwi walaviyi zamana, shakapanu wawaleka wagendi zawu.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pakati Beroya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Pashiru, walongu walii wawahimiziya Paulu na Sila wagendi Bereya. Katepu hera pawayingiriti aku, wagenditi mnumba ya Mlungu ya Wayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Wantu wa aku waweriti wapikinira nentu kuliku wantu walii wa Tesaloniki. Wauwankiti ujumbi ulii kwa lwamata lukulu, wawera wankugalolalola Malembu Mananagala kila lishaka, su kulola handa galii gawatakuliti Paulu na Sila gaweriti nakaka. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Wavuwa wawu wajimiriti na viraa wadala wa Shigiriki wa ntambu ya kunani na wapalu viraa. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Kumbiti, Wayawudi wa Tesaloniki pawavimaniti handa Paulu kaweriti kankubwera shisoweru sha Mlungu aku Bereya, wagenditi aku. Wanja kutenda fuju na kusonguziya shipinga sha wantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Walongu walii wawapelekiti Paulu kanongola kagendi kumbwani kumbiti Sila na Timotewu wasigaliti Beroya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Walongu walii wawapelekiti Paulu wagenditi pamwera nayomberi mpaka Aseni. Shakapanu, wawuya pamuhera na malagaliru kulawa kwa Paulu handa Sila na Timotewu wamfati kanongola ntambu yaiwezekana.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu kankuyowera na wantu wa Aseni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paulu pakaweriti kankuwahepa Sila na Timotewu aku Aseni, moyu gwakuwi gukalala nentu pakawoniti ntambu lushi alu paluweriti lumema shinyagu sha wamlungu. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Kalitakuziana na Wayawudi na wantu wamonga yawamluwa Mlungu munumba ya Mlungu, na kila lishaka kaweriti na matakuzianu mahali paweru pamwera na woseri walii wawalawiriti. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Wamonga wawafatiti falisafa ya Epikuru na Staiku walikakatala na yomberi. Wamonga watakuliti, “Kafira kutakula shishi ayu mtuwa visoweru?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Toziya Paulu kaweriti kankubwera kuusu Yesu na kuusu uzyuka, wamonga watakuliti, “lwonikana handa kankubwera kuusu milungu wa shihenja.” <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Hangu wamtoliti Paulu, wamjegiti Aleopagu, Watakula, “Tufira kuvimana shitwatira ashi shasyayi shaguweriti gwanguyowelera. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Vintu vimonga tuvipikaniriti kwa makutu getu viwonikana weri viloja kwatwenga. Tufira kuvimana vitwatira avi nvina mana gaa.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Wantu wa Aseni na wenikaya wamonga wa aku waweriti wankutumiya shaka shawu shoseri kuligambiziyana na kupikinira visoweru vyasyayi. <verse eid="ACT 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Su, Paulu kagolokiti kuulongolu kumdamu kwa Aleopagu, katakula, “Wenikaya wa Aseni! Mona kuwera mwenga, kwa vyoseri, ndo wantu wa dini nentu. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Mana panweriti nangupita aku na aku panola vinyagu vyenu vya kuguwira moniti pahala pa kutambikira pamu palembitwi ‘Kwa Mlungu yakamanika ndiri!’ Su, ayu yamjimira pota kuvimana, ndomweni yanumubwera kwamwenga. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Mlungu yakanyawiti pasipanu na vyoseri yaviweraamu, ndo Mtuwa gwa kumpindi na isi, yomberi kalivaga ndiri mnumba nkulu za kuluwa Mlungu yazinyawitwi na wantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Ama katendiritwi ndiri kwa mawoku ga wantu kuwera kafira shoseri, toziya mweni ndo yakawapanana woseri ukomu, yakawatenda wantu wapumuli na kuwapanana kila shintu. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kulawirana na muntu yumu kanyawiti maisi goseri na kugatenda galikali pasipanu poseri. Kaamuiti na kupanga pamberi nakamu ndii na koshi maisi aga megalikali. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Katenditi hangu, su maisi aga gapati kumfata, na handa vila kwa kupapasiya papaya, gapati kumfikira. Ata hangu kumbiti, Mlungu kapatali ndiri na kila yumu gwenu. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Handa yakatakuliti muntu yumu, ‘Mngati mwakuwi yomberi twenga tulikala, twankugenda na twankupumula!’ Ndo gambira washaili wenu wamonga ntambu yawatakuliti, ‘Twenga twawana wakuwi.’ <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Paiwera twenga twawana wa Mlungu, tufiruwa ndiri kumuhola Mlungu gambira zahabu ama mpiya ama ata libuwi lyalisongolitwi na wantu kwa kutulwa mng'ereng'etu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Mlungu katenda gambira kawona ndiri vipindi vilii wantu pawaweriti wangalimahala. Kumbiti vinu, kahimiziya wantu woseri kila pahali waleki vidoda vyawatenda. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Toziya katula lishaka lyeni hakapatozi pasipanu kwa kutenda galii yagafiriziya Mlungu kwajili ya muntu yumu yakamsyaguliti. Mlungu kawalanguziya woseri shitwatira ashi kwa kumzyukisiya muntu ayu kulawa kwawahowiti!” <verse eid="ACT 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Pawampikiniriti Paulu kankutakula kuusu vitwatira vya kuzyuka kwa wahowiti, wamonga wawu waguwiti kwa kusekelera, kumbiti wamonga walongiti, “Tufira kupikinira kayi kuusu shitwatira ashi” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Hangu, Paulu kawalekiti, kalawiti pamdamu. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Kumbiti wantu wavuwa ndiri wagenditi pamuhera na yomberi, wawera wajimira. Muwamu mwawu waweriti Dionisiwu gwa Aleopagu na mdala yumu yawamshema Damari na wamonga wawu.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Paulu kulii Korintu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Pa aga, Paulu kawukiti Aseni, kagenda Korintu. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Aku Korintu, kamwoniti Myawudi yumu wamshema Akula, muntu gwa Pontu. Akula pamuhera na Mdala gwakuwi yawamshema Prisila, wawuyiti kulawa Italiya mashaka galaa aga toziya Kayisari Klawudi kaweriti kalagaliriti Wayawudi woseri wawuki Rumi. Paulu kagenditi kuwalola, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />na toziya womberi waweriti wanyawa wa kusona mahema handa yomberi, Paulu katamiti na womberi katenda lihengu. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Kila lishaka lya kwoyera katenditi magambiziyanu mnumba ya Mlungu pakajeriti kukwega Wayawudi na Wagiriki. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Pa Sila na Timotewu kusoka kulawa Makedoniya, Paulu kanjiti kutumiya shaka shakuwi shoseri kwajili ya kubwera, kawalanguziya Wayawudi handa Yesu ndo Kristu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Pawamkomiti Paulu na kwanja kumwigilanga, yomberi kapunda nguwu zakuwi kulongolu kwawu pakalonga, “Pamwagamira ulamaweni, neni nahera likosa lyoseri kulawirana na shitwatira ashi. Na kwanjira vinu hanuwagenderi wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Su, kalawa panu kagenda kutama ukaya kwa muntu yumu mguwira Mlungu yawamshema Titu Yustu, mweni kaya yakuwi iweriti pakwegera na numba ya Mlungu ilii. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Krispu, mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu ilii, kamjimiriti Mtuwa yomberi pamuhera na walongu wakuwi woseri. Wakorintu wavuwa waupikiniriti ujumbi awu, wajimira na kubatiziwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Lishaka limu pashiru, Mtuwa kamgambiriti Paulu mmaonu, “Nagutira, gwendereyi kubwera pota kuwuya kumbeli, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Mana neni napanu pamwera nagwenga. Kwa hera mundu yakajera kukutenda toziya panu palushi pana wantu wavua wauwega waneni.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Su, Paulu katamiti aku pakafunda shisoweru sha Mlungu pakati pawu kwa shaka sha shinja shimu na nusu. <verse eid="ACT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Kumbiti shaka Galiu pakaweriti mkulu gwa mkowa gwa Akaya, Wayawudi wambatiti Paulu kwa pamwera na kumjega kumahakama. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Watakula, “Tumsitaki muntu ayu toziya ya kuwasongiziya wantu wamjimiri Mlungu kwa ntambu yawasingana na malagaliru.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Pamberi hera Paulu keniyanji kutakula, Galiu kawagambiriti Wayawudi, “Mpikinireni mwenga Wayawudi! Handa nakaka shitwatira ashi meshiweri likosa ama ukondola neni menweri kala kuwapikinira. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Kumbiti handa lishawuli lya ukakatala kuusu visoweru na matawu na malagaliru genu, mwamuwi maweni. Neni nfira ndiri kuwera mtoza gwa vitwatira avi!” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Su, kawawinga kulawa kumahakama. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Na womberi woseri wambata Sosteni mweni kaweriti mlongoziya gwa numba ya Mlungu, womberi wamkoma palaa palii palongoru pa shiyotera motu . Kumbiti Galiu kalishera ndiri shitwatira ashi ata padidini.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu kankuwuya kayi Antiokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Paulu kendereyiti kulikala aku Korintu kwa mashaka gatangala. Shakapanu kawagambiriti kwahere, kakwena uwatu kagenda Siriya pakawera na Prisila na Akula. Aku Kenkireya, kamogiti viri zakuwi toziya ya kulapa kwakalilapiti. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Wagenditi Efesu na panu Paulu kawalekiti Prisikila na Akula, pakagenda mnumba ya Mlungu, kankulitakuziyana na Wayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Wamluwiti katami nawomberi shaka shitali nentu, kumbiti kafiriti ndiri. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Su pakaweriti kankuwuka, katakuliti, “Mlungu pakafira hanizi kwamwenga kayi.” Kawuka Efesu kwa uwatu mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Yomberi pakasokiti mlushi lwa Kayisariya, yomberi kagenditi Yerusalemu kushilamusiya shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu, shakapanu kagenditi Antiokiya. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Katama aku katepu hera, shakapanu kendereyiti na mwanja kwa kupitira seemu za Firigiya na Galatiya kankuwatula moyu wafundwa woseri.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolu kankubwera Efesu na Korintu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Myawudi yumu yawamshema Apolu, mwiwuka gwa Alekizandiriya, kiziti Efesu. Kaweriti muntu kana luhala lwa kuyowera na yakawera na marifa makulu ga Malembu Mananagala. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Kaweriti kafundwa kuusu njira ayi ya Mtuwa na pakawera motumotu, kabweriti na kufunda kwa unakaka showeru sha Yesu tembera kaweriti kapata ubatizu wa Yohani hera. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Prisila na Akula pawampikaniriti kankuyowera kwa ugangamala mnumba ya Mlungu, wamtoliti kwawu wamfunda njira ayi ya Mlungu kwa unakaka nentu. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Apolu pakaamuiti kugenda Akaya, walongu walii wampananiti moyu kwa kuwalembera wafundwa kulii Akaya wamyangi. Pakiziti aku, kaweziti kwa utanga wa manemu ga Mlungu, kuwatangitira nentu walongu walii wawapatiti kuwera wajimira, <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Toziya kendereyiti kuwakanka Wayawudi paweru pakawalanguziya kwa visoweru vya Malembu Mananagala kuwera Yesu ndo Kristu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paulu kankubwera kulii Efesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Shaka Apolu pakaweriti Korintu, Paulu kagenditi mwanja seemu za bala, kaziti Efesu kweni kawoniti wafundwa wamu. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Kakosiiti, “hashi, pampatiti kuwera wajimira myangiti Rohu. Mnanagala?” Nawomberi wamwankula, “Ndala! Hatweni pikanira handa kwana Rohu Mnanagala.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Nayomberi katakula, “Vinu mpatiti ubatizu wa ntambu gaa?” Wamwankula, “ubatizu wa Yohani.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Nayomberi Paulu katakula, “ubatizu wa Yohani uweriti wa kulanguziya handa wantu waleka vidoda. Yohani kawagambiriti wantu wamjimiri ulii yomberi yakaweriti kakwiza pa yomberi, yaani Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Pa kupikinira aga, wabatiziti kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Su, Paulu kawatulira mawoku, na Rohu Mnanagala kawasulukira. Wanja kutakula likabila luhenga na kubwera ujumbi wa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Woseri waweriti wantu lilongu na mbili. <verse eid="ACT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Kwa shaka sha myezi mitatu Paulu kaweriti kankugenda munumba za Mlungu, kawera na matakuliranu ga kukwegiziya nentu kuusu ufalumi wa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Kumbiti wamonga waweriti wakakatala, walema kujimira, wanja kuyowera vidoda kuusu njira ayi ya Mtuwa mulijojiniku lya wantu. Panu Paulu kaulekiti uganja nawomberi, kawatola pambwega wafundwa wakuwi walii, kaweriti kankuyowera nawomberi kila lishaka panumba ya masomu ga Tiranu. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Kendereyiti kutenda hangu kwa shaka sha vinja viwili ata wanalushi woseri wa Asiya, Wayawudi na wantu wa maisi gamonga, waweza kupikinira shisoweru sha Mtuwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Mlungu katenditi mauzauza ga kulikangasha kwa mawoku ga Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Wantu waweriti wankutola shitambala na nguwu zimonga zya lihengu zyeni Paulu kaweriti kankuvala, wazijegiti kwa walweli, nawomberi waponiziwa malweri gawu na walii wawaweriti na washamshera wadoda walawa. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Wayawudi wamu yawawusiya wamshera wadoda. Wagenditi mwanja aku na aku wankujera kulitumiya litawu lya Mtuwa Yesu mweni Paulu kankumbwera. <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Wana saba wa Sikewa na Mtambika Mkulu wa Shiyawudi, woseri watenditi hangu. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Kumbiti shamshera kadoda kawankula, “Nummana Yesu, nummana viraa Paulu, kumbiti mwenga mwa gaa?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Shakapanu muntu ulii yakalendemeriti kawakopokera woseri kwa likakala, kawakanka likakala. Na wana awa wa Skewa watuga kulawa mnumba mlii pawawera shivula na kuwera na vironda. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Kila muntu Efesu aku, Myawudi na muntu yakawera ndiri Myawudi, kapikaniriti kuusu shitwatira ashi. Woseri waweriti na lyoga, walikwisa litawu lya Mtuwa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Wawumini watangala walawiriti wajimira paweru vitwatira avi vyawaweriti watenda. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Wamonga waweriti wankutenda vitwatira vya uhawi shaka shipititi, wajojiniriti vintola vyawu, wavilunguziya paulongolu pa woseri. Wakisiyiti galama ya vintola avi, wawona ifikira vipandi vya shuma malongu mhanu elufu. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Toziya ayi, shisoweru sha Mtuwa shendereya kweneya na shiwera na likakala nentu.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndewu aku Efesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Pa vitwatira avi, Paulu kaamuiti kugenda Yerusalemu kwa kupitila Makedoniya na Akaya katakuliti, “Pa kusoka aku, infiruwa kuiwona Rumi viraa.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Avi, kawatumiti wawili wa ntumintumi wakuwi, Timotewu na Erastu walonguleri genda Makedoniya, yomberi kalikaliti kwa katepu aku Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Shaka ashi ndo pailawiriti ndewu nkulu aku Efesu toziya ya njira ayi ya Mtuwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Kuweriti na munyawa shuma yumu wamshema Demetiriu, yomberi kaweriti na lihengu lya kunyawa vinyagu vya numba ya mlungu gwa shidala yawamshema Aritemi. Lihengu ali liwayupiti wanyawa wakuwi mota ngulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Demetiriu kawajojiniriti pamwera watenda lihengu awa pamwera na wamonga wawaweriti na lihengu handa ali, kawagambira, “Wanalushi, muvimana handa shipatu shangu shilawirana na biyashala ayi. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Vinu, muweza kupikinira na kuliwonera maweni vitwatira avi Paulu kankuvitenda, panu Efesu hera ndiri, ira viraa koseri Muasiya. Yomberi kawashawishi na kuwagalambula wantu wajumiri handa wamilungu walii yawanyawitwi na wantu milungu ndiri ata shididini. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Su iwezekana kuwera biyashara yetu iweri na litawu lidoda. Hangu hera ndiri, kumbiti shitwatira ashi shiweza kuitenda numba ya mlungu Aritemi iweri shintu ndiri sha mana. Shakapanu nzyumi zakuwi ayu Asiya na pasipanu poseri ntambu yawamguwira, Hayiperi.” <verse eid="ACT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Pawapikiniriti aga, waweriti na maya, wayanja kubotanga umatu, “Mkulu ndo Aritemi gwa Efesu!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Kaya yoseri imema fuju. Wawavamiya Gayu na Alisitariku, wenikaya wa Makedoniya, weni waweriti wanamwanja wayaguwi Paulu, watuga nawomberi mpaka kumdamu gwa madingu. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulu mweni kafiriti kushigendera shipinga sha wantu awa, kumbiti waumini walii wamleweleriti. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Wakulu wa sirikali wamonga wa aku kumkoa wa Asiya, wawaweriti maganja wakuwi, wamjegiriti Paulu ujumbi wankumluwa nakalitula muatali kwa kugenda kweni kumdamu gwa madingu. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Shaka shilii, wantu wamu waweriti pawabota hangu na wamonga vilii. Wantu wavuwa wavimaniti ndiri iwera ashi wawera aku. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Toziya Wayawudi wamtenda Alekizanda kalawiri kulongolu, wamu wa wantu mushipinga shilii walisheriti kuwera ndo mweni. Su, Alekizanda kawapungiriti wantu kwa liwoku pakafira kujiteteya paulongolu pa shipinga sha wantu walii. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Kumbiti pawavimaniti weri yomberi ndo Myawudi, woseri kwa liziwu limu washowangana, “Mkulu ndo Aritemi gwa Efesu!” Wendereya kushowangana showangana hangu kwa shaka sha masaa mawili. <verse eid="ACT 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Upeleru kalani gwa lushi kafawuliti kuwanyamaziya, kawagambira, “Wanalushi wa Efesu, kila muntu kavimana handa kaya ayi ya Efesu ndo mlolera gwa numba ya mlungu gwa shidala Aritemi na mlolera gwa shinyagu shilii shashiguwiti kulawa kumpindi. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Kwahera yakaweza kulema shitwatira ashi. Hangu su, munyamali, namtenda shoseri pota hepera. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Muwashema wantu awa panu tembera wayigilanga ndiri numba ya mlungu ama kumwigilanga mlungu gwetu gwa shidala. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Handa, Demetiriu na watenda lihengu wayaguwi wawera na masitaka gawu kuusu wantu awa, pana mahakama na wakulu wa mikoni, waweza kusitakiana aku. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Handa pamuwera na visoweru vyamonga, vyaviwagaziya, muvijegi pashiyotera motu yapafiruwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Toziya tuweza kusitakiwa kwa kujega ndewu kulawirana na vituku vya lelu. Ndewu ayi kwahera toziya ya nakaka na metusindi kulaviya toziya za nyanyi za ndewu ayi.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Pakatakuliti aga, kakumaliriti kuliwona.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Kulawa Makedoniya kugenda Akaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Payiperiti ndewu ilii Paulu kawashemiti pamwera waumini walii, kawagambira visoweru vya kawayupa moyu. Shakapanu kawagambira kwahere, kagenda Makedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Kapitiriti Seemu zya isi zilii kankuwayupa wantu moyu kwa visoweru vitangala. Shakapanu kasokiti Akaya. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Kweni katamiti kwa myezi mitatu. Pakaweriti kankulitanda kugenda Siriya, kayambuliti handa Wayawudi waweriti wankumtendera mpangu mdoda, hangu kaamuwiti kuwuya kwa kupitira Makedoniya <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Sopata, mwana gwa Piru, kulawa Beroya, wagenditi pamwera nayomberi, viraa Alisitariku na Sekundi kulawa Tesaloniki, Gayu kulawa Deribi, Timotewu, Tukiku na Tirofimu, kulawa mkowa gwa Asiya, na Timotewu <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Awa watulonguliti na kutuhepera Trowa kulii. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Tukweniti uwatu mkulu kulawa Filipi payipititi sikukuwi ya Mabumunda gankali kulekera simika, na pa mashaka mhanu shakapanu tuliwoniti pamwera Trowa kulii. Aku tulikaliti kwa shaka sha lijuma limu.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu katyangiriti Trowa mala ya upeleru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Jumamosi pashimii tuliwoniti tumegi libumunda. Toziya Paulu kafiriti kuwuka shirawu yakuwi, kawabweliriti wantu na kwendeleya kuyowera nawomberi mpaka pashiru pa ligonu. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Vikoloboyi vivuwa viweriti viyaka mmpindi mushindambi Mshumba pawaweriti wankuliwona. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Mndemba yumu litawu lyakuwi Eutuku kaweriti kalivaga palidilisha shaka Paulu pakaweriti kankwendereya kubwera, Eutuku kanjiti kusizira shididini shididini mpaka mbota zimpata, kapatuka pasi kulawa mgolofa ya tatu. Wamlopoziya kahowiti kala. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Kumbiti Paulu kasulukiti pasi, kasuntamala, kamkisikira na kulonga “Namwina lyoga mana kwana ukomu wankali mngati mwakuwi.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Shakapanu kakwena kayi mligolofa, kalimega libumunda, kaliya. Kendeleyiti kubwera kwa shaka shivuwa mpaka mandawira putiputi, shakapanu kawuka. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Wantu walii wamtoliti mndemba ulii ukaya pakiwa mkomu nakamu. Wapata shinyamaliru shikulu.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulawa Trowa kugenda Miletu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Twenga tukweniti uwatu mkulu tulonguliriti kugenda Asu kweni twangamtoliti Paulu. Katugambiriti tutendi ntambu ayi, mana kafiriti kwiza aku kwa kupitira isi iyuma. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Shaka pakatuwoniti Asu kulii, tumkweniziya mumuwatu mkulu, tugenda Mituleni. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Kulawa aku tugenditi tusoka Kiu shirawu yakuwi. Lishaka lya pili, tusulusiyiti nanga Samu na shirawu yakuwi tusokiti Miletu. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paulu kaweriti kafira kwendeleya na mwanja kwa uwatu mkulu pota kuwuyira Efesu su nakakawalira nentu aku Asiya. Kaweriti na kanongola ya kusoka Yerusalemu kwa sikukuwi ya Pentekosti handa iwezikana.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu kankuwagambira kwa heri wazewi wa Efesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Kulawa Miletu Paulu katumiti ujumbi Efesu, kwa wazewi wa shipinga sha yawamjimira Yesu waliwoni nayomberi. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Pawawuyiti kwakuwi, kawagambiriti, “Muvimana ntambu yandamiti na mwenga pashiru poseri kwanjira mulishaka lilii lya kwanja pansokiti Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Muvimana ntambu yanumtenderiti Mtuwa kwa unanaga woseri, kwa masozi na maholu gambatiti kulawirana na mipangu ya ufyangu ya Wayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Muvimana handa hapeni nzindi ata shididini kuwabwelera paweru na mkaya mwamwennga na kuwafundeni shoseri shakuwatangitileni. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Nuwaberiziya mwawoseri Wayawudi, viraa na wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi wamgalambukiri Mlungu na kuwera na njimiru mu Mtuwa gwetu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Na vinu, mumpikinireni! Neni, payiwera nankumjimira Rohu, nunkugenda Yerusalemu pota kuvimana yagafira kumpata aku. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Shanushimana hera ndo handa Rohu Mnanagala kankunanguziya pakati pa kila lushi handa shifungu na ntabiku ndo vyanguhepera. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Kumbiti, nankuukwisa ukomu wangu kuwera shintu nentu kwaneni mladi hera malili untumintumi wangu na lihengu lilii lyakampananiti Mtuwa Yesu nulitendi, yani nankuziyi Shisoweru Shiwagira sha manemu ga Mlungu.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Mpita muwamu mweni woseri pabwera ufalumi wa Mlungu.Na vinu, nuvimana kwahera ata yumu gwenu hakamoni kayi. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Hangu, leru ayi nankuwalanguziya nakamu handa payilawira kahowa yumu gwenu, neni nahera lawama yoseri. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Toziya hapeni nzindi ata padidini kuwabwelerani nfiru yoseri ya Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Mulikali weri maweni, mshiloleri shipinga shilii sheni Rohu Mnanagala kawatula mwenga muweri walelwa wakuwi. Mushiloli shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu, Mlungu yakashihemeriti kwa mwazi gwa mwana gwakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Nuvimana handa pambuka kala neni wamaminyi wakalipa hawawingilirani, na hapeni waweri na lusungu kwa shipinga ashi. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Ata kulawa muwamu mwenu hawalawili wantu weni hantakuli vitwatira vya kupyota su kuwahowiziya wantu na kuwatenda wawafati womberi hera. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Hangu muweri masu pamlihola handa kwa shaka sha vinja vitatu, pashiru na paliwala ndoka ndiri kumubera kila yumu gwenu kwa masozi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Vinu nankuwatula mumawoku ga Mlungu, kwa shisoweru sha manemu gakuwi, ndosheni shiweza kuwanyawa mwenga na kuwapanana uhala pamuhera nawomberi woseri yawapungitwi. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Neni nfirandiri ata mala yimu shuma, wala zaabu, wala nguwu za muntu yoseri. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Muvimana maweni handa ntenda lihengu kwa mawoku gangu namweni su mbati shakuwatanga na sha namweni. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Namweri nankuwayupani mashaka goseri mfanu handa kwa kutenda lihengu shiasi ashi tufiruwa kuwatanga walii wahera likakala patulihola visoweru vya Mtuwa Yesu mweni, ‘Mbaka nentu kulavia kuliku kuyanga.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Pa katakuliti kala aga, Paulu kasuntamaliti pamuhera nawomberi woseri, kamluwa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Woseri waweriti wankulira, na kumgambira Paulu kwahere kwa kumkisikira na kumunonera. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Shawaweriti na maholu nashu nentu shiweriti showeru shakashitakuliti handa hapeni wamoni kayi. Su, wampeleka mpaka kuuwatu mkulu.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Paulu kankugenda Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Patumaliliti kumgambira kwaheri, tukweniti uwatu mkulu tugenda mpaka kosi. Shirawu yakuwi tusokiti Rodi, na kulawa aku tugenditi patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Aku, tuwoniti uwatu mkulu yaiweriti yankugenda Foiniki, hangu tukweniti, tugenda mwanja. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Patusokiti kala pahala peni tuweziti kuwona kupiru, tupitiriti uwega wakuwi wa kushana tugenda Siriya. Tupumliriti mulushi lwa Tiru peni uwatu mkulu ilii iweriti wankusulusiya visanka vyakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Tuwoniti waumini wamu aku, na tulivaga pamwera nawomberi kwa lijuma limu. Kwa likakala lya Rohu, wamgambira Paulu kotukugenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Kumbiti shaka shetu pashiperiti tuwukiti woseri pamuhera na wadala na wana wawu watupelekiti mpaka kunja ya lushi. Patusokiti kumbwani, twawoseri tusundamaliti na tumluwa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Shakapanu patulongiti kwaheri, twenga tukwena uwatu mkulu, nawomberi wawuya ukaya kwawu. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Twenga twendereyiti na mwanja gwetu kulawa Tiru tusoka Tolemaisi kweni tuwalamsiya wawumini, tulikaliti nawomberi lishaka limu. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Shirawu yakuwi tuwukiti na tusoka Kayisariya. Aku tulikaliti ukaya kwa Mwinjilisti Filipi yomberi kaweriti yumu gwa walii saba wawasyaguliti kutanga Yerusalemu kulii. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Kaweriti na wahinga wamsheshi weni waweriti na shipaji sha kutakulira ujumbi wa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Pawalikaliti aku mashaka ng'o, mbuyi yumu wamshema Agabu kiziti kulawa Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Katuyiziriti, katola Mkanda gwa Paulu, kalitawa mumawoku na mumagulu Kalonga, “Rohu Mnanagala katakula hangu, ‘Wayawudi Yerusalemu wamtawi ntambu ayi muntu kana mkanda agu na wantu wa maisi wamkamli.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Patupikiniriti aga, twenga na wantu wamonga walii wawaweriti panu tumluwiti Paulu kotukugenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Kumbiti Paulu kankuliti, “Mfira kutenda shishi? Mfira kugumega moyu gwangu kwa masozi? Neni nwera kala hera ndiri kutatilwa mnumba kulii Yerusalemu, ila ata kuhowa kwajili ya Mtuwa Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Patusinditi kumuzyangazyanga tunyamala, tulonga hera, “Shakafira Mtuwa shitendeki!” <verse eid="ACT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Pawatamiti palii kwa katepu, tuyopiti visanka vyetu, twendereyiti na mwanja kugenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Wamu wa wafundwa walii wa Kayisariya wagenditi pamuhera natwenga, watujega ukaya kwa Mnasoni yomberi tuweriti twankugenda kulikala nayomberi kwa katepu. Mnasoni kaweriti mwenikaya gwa kupiru na kaweriti muwumini gwa mashaka gavuwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu kankugenda kumlamsiya Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Patuyingiriti Yerusalemu, walongu wawumini watuyangiti weri nentu. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Shirawu yakuwi Paulu kagenditi pamwera natwenga kumlamusiya Yakobu, na wazewi na shipinga sha wantu wawamjimira Yesu Kristu waweriti viraa. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Pawamlamsiyiti kala, Paulu kawayupiti shisoweru kamili kuusu goseri Mlungu gakaweriti kagatenda pakati pa wantu wa maisi kwa njira ya lihengu lyakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Pawapikiniriti aga, wamkwisa Mlungu. Shakapanu kamgambira Paulu, “Mlongu, guweza kuwona handa kwana Wayawudi maelufu weni vinu wawera wajimira na woseri awa wagatenda weri malagaliru. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Wapata visoweru vyakuwi handa guweriti gwanguwafunda Wayawudi yawalikala muwamu mwa wantu wa maisi gamonga nawagashera ndiri malagaliru ga Musa, kotukuwayigiziya jandu wananguta wawu na kotukuzifata mila za Wayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Nakaka wapikinira handa kasoka kala panu. Tutendi hashi, shakapanu? <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Su, gutendi handa ntambu yatukugambiziyiti. Twa panu wantu msheshi weni watula nazili. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Gwingiri pamuhera na womberi, gulipungi pamuhera na womberi na gulipi na shyasi shashiwusika kwa womberi shakapanu wamogi viri zawu. Su kila muntu hakavimani kuwera visoweru vyoseri vilii vyawagambiritwi kuusu gwenga vyahera mana, kumbiti gwenga gumweni gwendereya weri na kugajimira malagiliru ga Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Kuusu wantu walii wa maisi gamonga wantu yawamjimira Yesu, tuwajegera kala luhamba twankuwagambira vitwatira vyatuamuwiti, waleki kuliya shoseri shawatambikiriti kwa milungu, nawalanda mwazi ama nawaliya vinofu vya shigongolu yawaminduwitwi na waleki uhumba.” <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Su lishaka lyalifatiti Paulu kawatoliti wantu walii na kalipunga pamuhera nawu. Shakapanu kingira Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, pakabwera visoweru vya upeleru wa mashaka ga kulipunga na tambiku meitendwi kwa kila muntu.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu kankutulwa mlikakala munumba ngulu ya kuluwira Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Shaka mashaka saba aga pagiziti kupera, Wayawudi waweriti walawa pamkoa gwa Asiya wamwoniti Paulu Mnumba nkulu ya kumluwa Mlungu. Su, wasonguziya maya mushipinga shoseri sha wantu, wamkamula Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />“Wanaisi wa Israeli, wabotanga Mtutangi! Ayu ndomweni ulii muntu yakawafunditi wantu kila pahala shitwatira shawashilema wantu wa Israeli, yagalema Malagaliru ga Musa na pahala panu pananagala. Ata vinu kawayingiziya wantu wa maisi gamonga Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu na kupatula uhumba pahala panu pananagala.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Toziya ya kutakula hangu ndo kuwera waweriti wamwona Tirofimu, mwenikaya gwa Efesu, kaweriti pamuhera na Paulu mlushi, womberi walisheriti kuwera Paulu kaweriti kamwingiziya Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Lushi loseri lwingira ndewu, wantu wiza kulawa wega zoseri, wamlaviyiti Paulu kunja Kunumba nkulu ya Mlungu, na palaa panu magomi itatwa ya Numba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Waweriti kala kumlaga kumbiti visoweru vimwizira mkulu gwa wanjagila wa shiroma kuwera Yerusalemu yoseri iweriti imema ndewu. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Kamu kamu mkulu gwa njagira kawatola wanjagila na mkulu gwa wanjagila, kashigendera shipinga sha wantu. Nawomberi pawamwoniti mkulu gwa njagira na wanjagila, waleka kumkoma Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Mkulu gwa jeshi kamgenderiti Paulu, kambata na kuamuwa wamtawi minyololu mushimba. Shakapanu kawakosiiti, “Ndo muntu gaa ayu, na katenda shishi?” <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Wamonga mshipinga sha wantu shilii waweriti wankubwera shintu ashi na wamonga shintu shilii. Toziya ya ndewu ayi. Mkulu gwa wanjagila kapofola kulimana shawuli kamili. Hangu, kaamuwiti wantu wakuwi wamjegi Paulu kuliboma. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Paulu pakasokiti palukweneru, wanjagila wampapiti toziya ya ndewu ya wantu. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Toziya wantu mushipinga shikulu wamfatiti pawabotanga, “gumlagiri patali!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu kankulitakuliziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Pawaweriti wankumwingiziya muboma, Paulu kamluwiti mkulu gwa wajengeni kalonga, “Weza kutakula shintu?” Mkulu gwa njagira ulii kamwankula, “Hashi, gushimana shigiriki?” <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />“Kwani gwenga ndo ulii Mmisri ulii mashana hera kayanjishiti ungondu na kawalonguziya majahili elufu msheshi mpaka kushiwala?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulu kankula, “Neni ndo Myawudi, mwiwuka gwa Tarisu pa Kilikiya, neni ndo mwiwuka gwa lushi lwalumanikana. Shondi nukuluwa, gunekeziyi ntakuli na wantu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Mkulu ulii gwa wanjagila kamjimira. Hangu Paulu kagolokiti panani pa lukweneru, kawapungira mawoku wantu walii, na pawalikaliti jiii, kanja kuyowera nawomberi kwa Shiebraniya.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Mwawalongu wangu na ashina tati, mpikinira vinu panalitakulura paulongolu penu!” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Pawapikiniriti pakayowera nawomberi kwa Shiebraniya wongera kutama jii kuliku shaka shipititi na Paweru kendereya kulonga.<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Neni ndo Myawudi, mwiwuka gwa Tarisu Mukilikiya. Kumbiti neleritwi palaa panu palushi lya Yerusalemu pasi ya ukufunzi Gamalieli. Mfunditwi kufata kwa ugangamala malagaliru ga wazewi wetu. Nuliraviyiti kwa moyu goseri kwa Mlungu kuwera mwenga ntambu ya muwera leru. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Nuwatesiti ata kuwalaga wantu walii wawafatiti njira ayi. Nuwakamliti wapalu kwa wadala na kuwatatira mshibetubetu. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mtambika Mkulu na shipinga shoseri sha wazewi waweza kushilanguziya shitwatira ashi. Kulawa kwawu mwankiti luhamba yawalembiti walongu walii Wayawudi yawaweriti aku Dameski. Ng'enditi Dameski su nuwakamuli wantu awa na kuwajega watatirwa mpaka Yerusalemu su wapananwi azabu.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu kankuyowera kuusu kulopuziwa kwakuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Su, panweriti mnjira pakwegera kuyingira Dameski, ipata saa sita paliwala, uweru ukulu ulawa kumpindi ulawira vumu uwalira wega zoseri. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Panu nguwiti pasi, mbikanira liziwu ling'ambira, ‘Sauli, Sauli! Kwa shishi gundesa?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Neni ngosiiti, ‘Gani gwenga, Mtuwa?’ Nayomberi kang'ambira. ‘Neni na Yesu gwa Nazareti ndo yomberi yaguntesa.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Wayangu walii wawoniti uweru ulii kumbiti wapikinira ndiri liziwu lya ulii yakayoweriti naneni. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Ngosiya, ‘Ndendi shishi Mtuwa?’ Na Mtuwa kanangula, ‘Gugoloki, gugendi Dameski na aku hawakugambiri vyoseri vyeni Mlungu wakupangira kutenda.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Kulawirana na uweru ukalipa mwezandiri kuwona na hangu iwabidi wayangu walii kunongoziya kwa kung'ola liwoku mpaka nsoka Dameski<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Aku kuweriti na muntu yumu yawamshema Ananiya, muntu mguwira Mlungu, mweni kujimira malagaliru getu na yawamupanana ligoya nentu kulongolu kwa Wayawudi yawaweriti walikala Dameski. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Yomberi kiziti kunola, kagoloka pakwegera naneni, kalonga, ‘Mlongu Sauli! Guwoni kayi.’ Palaa palii kawona kayi, numulola. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Shakapanu Ananiya kalonga, ‘Mlungu gwa wambuyi wetu kakusyagula gwenga gupati kuvimana mafiliru gakuwi na kumlola ntumintumi gwakuwi muheri na kumpikinira mweni pakayowera. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kwa mana hauweri upitawu kwa wantu woseri pawawagambira galii gwagagawoniti na kugapikanira. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Vinu su, ga shishi kushelewa nentu? Gugoloki, gubatizwi na kuwusilirwa vidoda vyaku kwa kuluwa litawu lyakuwi.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu kashemwa kuwabwelera wantu wa maisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Su, muyiti Yerusalemu na panweriti nankumluwa Mlungu munumba nkulu moniti mawonu. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Numwoniti Mtuwa pakang'ambira, ‘Guwuki Yerusalemu kanongola kwa mana wantu wa panu hapeni wawujimiri upitawu waku kuusu neni.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />‘Mtuwa’ neni numwankula, ‘wavimana pota kufifa handa neni ndo ulii yakaweriti kankupitapita munumba za Mlungu na kuwabata na kuwakoma walii yawaweriti wankujimira. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Na handa shaka pitawu gwaku Stefanu pawamlagiti, namweni neni nweriti palii panjimilianiti na shitwatira ashi na kugalolera makoti ga walii yawaweriti wankumlaga.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Mtuwa kang'ambira, ‘Gugendi, nukutumi patali kwa isi za Wayawudi ndiri.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Mpaka panu, wantu walii waweriti wankumpikinira, kumbiti pandakuliti visoweru avi, wayanjiti kutakula kwa liziwu likulu, “Guwusiyi Pasi panu muntu gwa ntambu ayi katakiwa ndiri kulikala.” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Wandereiti kubwerabwera aku na wankutikinyia makoti gawu na kusulusiya lidiku kumpindi. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Mkulu gwa majangira kawagambiriti wantu wakuwi wamjegi Paulu mnumba ya liboma, kawagambira wawasyatangi mboku su wapati kuvimana shanzu sha Wayawudi kumtendera umatu. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Kumbiti pawaweriti wankumtawa su wasyatangwi mboku, Paulu kamkosiyiti mkulu gwa majagira yumu yakagolokiti panu, “Hashi, ndo yapafiruwa kwamwenga kumsyatanga mboku mwanalushi gwa Rumi pambeli hakenitozwi?” <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Mkulu gwa njagira ulii pakapikaniriti aga, kamyupiti shisoweru mkulu gwa njagira kalonga, “Gufira gutendi shishi? Muntu ayu ndo mwanalushi gwa Rumi!”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Mkulu gwa njagira kamgendiriti Paulu kamgambira, “Gung'ambiri, hashi gwenga ndo mwanalushi gwa Rumi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Paulu kamwankula “nyina,”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Mkulu gwa njagira kalonga, “Naneni nwera mwanalushi gwa Rumi kwa kulipira shiyasi shikulu.” Paulu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">“Kumbiti neni na mwanalushi gwa Rumi kwa kwiwuka.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Wantu walii weni waweriti kala kumlolera Paulu wawukiti saa iraa ilii. Ata mkulu gwa njagira ulii katiriti pakavimaniti handa Paulu ndo mwanalushi gwa Rumi na handa kaweriti kamtawalira kala minyololu.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu palongolu pashiyotera motu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Shirawu yakuwi, mkulu gwa njagira kafiriti kuvimana masitaka geni Wayawudi waweriti wamsitaki Paulu. Hangu, kamyopoliti Paulu minyololu, kaamuwa watambika wakulu, na shiyotera motu shoseri waliwoni. Shakapanu kamjegiti Paulu, kamgolosiya paulongolu pa shiyotera motu .<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulu kawalola ndii wanashiyotera motu walii, shakapanu kanja kutakula, “Mwalongu wangu, mpaka leru nweriti nankulikala na nfiru iherepa paulongolu pa Mlungu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Panu Mtambika Mkulu Ananiya kawahimiziya walii yawaweriti wagoloka pakwegera na Paulu wamwakuli mumlomu. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Su, Paulu kamgambira, “Mlungu mweni hakakuwakuli mbalawandi gwenga handa shibambaza shawapakaziiti shokaa! Guwera hashi, kulikala panu su guntozi shikamalagaliru na aku gumweni gwenga gugamega malagaliru kwa kuhimiziya wang'omi!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Wantu wawaweriti wagoloka palii wamgambira Paulu, “Gumwigira mtambika mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu!”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Paulu kankula, “Walonga wangu, nuvimana ndiri handa yomberi ndo Mtambika Mkulu. Mana Malembu mananagala galonga, ‘Nagumtakulira vidoda mkolamlima gwa wantu waku.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Shaka ashi Paulu kalimaniti kala handa seemu yimu ya wanashiyotera motu walii iweriti ndo Masadukayu na yimonga Mafalisayu. Su, katakula kwa liziwu likulu paulongolu pa shiyotera motu , “Walongu wangu, neni ndo Mfalisayu, mwana gwa Mfarisayu. Neni wanjega kushiyotera motu toziya nulitumbira handa wahowiti hawazyuki.”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Pakatakuliti kala aga, ndewu ikalipa ilawiriti pakati pa Mafalisayu na Masadukayu na shipinga shipalanganika. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Shanziru sheni Shiweriti ashi, Masadukayu wakolera handa wahowiti wazyuki ndiri, kwahera wantumintumi wa kumpindi, na rohu zyeni kwahera. Kumbiti Mafalisayu wajimira goseri aga matatu. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Umatu uyongerekiti na wamonga wa wafunda wa Malagaliru ga shipinga sha Mafalisayu wagolokiti na kulavia malalamiku gawu kwa likakala, “Hatweniwoni shoseri shilii shikondola pakati pa muntu ayu, pamonga iwera handa rohu ama ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kuyowera na yomberi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Ndewu iweriti nkulu ata mkulu gwa wanjagila katira handa Paulu mewampapulangi vipandivipandi. Hangu, kawahimiziyiti wanjagila wakuwi kwingira pakati paa shipinga shilii, wamlaviyi Paulu na kumwuziya mngati mliboma.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Pashiru pafatiti, Mtuwa kagolokiti pakwegera na Paulu, kamgambira, “Guliyupi moyu! Gumbitawulira panu Yerusalemu, hagutendi ntambu irayi ayi mlushi lwa Rumi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayawudi wankutenda mpangu gwa kumlaga Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Pawushiiti, Wayawudi watenditi waliwoni kwa bada. Waliyupa shiapu, “Hapeni tuliyi wala kulanda mpaka patuweri kala tumlagi Paulu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Wantu nentu ya malongu msheshi ndo yawatenditi mpangu gwa kutenda hangu. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Su wagenditi kwa Mtambika Mkulu na wazewi, walonga, “Twenga tulilapira handa hapeni tuliyi shoseri kwa milomu yetu mpaka patumlaga Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Vinu su, mwenga pamwera na shiyotera motu guwatumi wajumbi kwa mkulu gwa majengeni su wamjegi Paulu kwamwenga pamlipayira handa mfira kuwayupa shisoweru shiherepa nentu kuusu yomberi. Tuweriti ndiri kala kumlaga ata pamberi pa kusoka panu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Kumbiti mwana gwa mlongu gwakuwi Paulu kapikiniriti kuusu mpangu agu, hangu kagenda mngati mwa boma kamgambira Paulu kuusu mpangu agu. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Panu Paulu kamshema yumu gwa wanjagila, kamgambira, “Gumtoli mndemba ayu kwa mkulu gwa wanjagila, kwana shintu sha kukugambira.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Mnjagira kamtola mndemba ayu, kumlonguziya mpaka kwa mkulu gwa wanjagila, kalonga, “Mtatilwa ulii Paulu kanshema kanduwa numjegi mntemba ayu kwaku toziya kana shitwatira sha kukugambira.” <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Mkulu gwa wanjagila kamkoliti liwoku mndemba ayu kamjega pahala pagweka, kamkosiya, “Gwana shishi sha kung'ambira?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Yemberi kalonga, “Wayawudi waligambirana wakuluwi numjegi Paulu Pashiyotera motu wankulipayira handa shiyotera motu shifira kupata visoweru avi kamili nentu kuusu yomberi. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Kumbiti gwenga nagujimira, toziya wantu wavuwa nentu ya malongu msheshi walitanda kala kumkamula, walitatira weni mushirapu kuwera hapeni waliyi ama kulanda mpaka wamlagi huti Paulu. Vinu wakala pawahepera lagilu lyaku” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Mkulu gwa wanjagila kalonga, gugendi zaku kotukumgambira muntu yoseri handa gunjegera visoweru avi.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu wankumjega kwa mkulu gwa mkowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Su, mkulu gwa jeshi kawashemiti wanjagila wawili kawagambira, “Muwatandi kala wanjagila miya mbili, wakwena falasi malongu saba na wanjagila miya mbili yawawera na migoha, wagendi Kaisariya, muweri kala kuwuka pamberi pa saa tatu pashiru. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Mtandi falasi wamu kwajili ya Paulu, wamjegiti Salama kwa Felisi, mkulu gwa mkowa.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Shakapanu mkulu ayu gwa shenta kalembiti hangu luhamba, <verse eid="ACT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Neni Klawudi Lusiya nunkukulembera gwenga mtuwa Felisi, mkulu gwa mkowa. Nukulamsiya! <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />‘Wayawudi wamkamuliti muntu ayu na sambira wamlagi mewang’ambiriti ndiri handa yomberi ndo mwanalushi gwa Rumi na hangu ng'enda pamuhera na wanjagila numlopoziya. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Numjegiti panlogolu pa shiyotera motu shawu shikulu nfira kuvimana shanziru sha masitaka gawu. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Nyambuliti handa masitaka geni gahusu lukakatala lwa seemu zimu zya malagaliru gawu na hangu monandiri handa katenda shoseri shifiruwa wamlagi ama wamtatiri mshibetubetu. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Pawang'ambiriti handa Wayawudi waweriti watenda mpangu gwa kumlaga, amuwiti kumjega kwaku, nuwagambira wasitaki wakuwi wajegi mashitaka gawu kulongolu kwaku.” <verse eid="ACT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Su, wanjagila awa wamtoliti Paulu handa ntambu yawawalagaliriti, wamjega pashiru palii mpaka Antipatiri. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Shirawu yakuwi wanjagila wa magulu wawuyiti kuliboma, wawaleka wanjagila walii wawakwena falasi wandereyiti na mwanja pamwera na Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Pawasokiti Kaisariya wamupiti mkulu gwa mkowa su luhamba na kumtula Paulu pasi pa ukolamlima wakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Felisi pakabetuliti luhamba alu kawakosiiti Paulu kalawa kumkoa gaa. Pawamgambiriti handa kaweriti kalawa kumkoa gwa Kilikiya. <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />Kalonga, “hampikiniri lisitaka lyaku pawasoka kala wasitaki waku.” Shakapanu kaamuwa Paulu wamloleri pamdamu gwa Herodi.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Wayawudi wankumsitaki Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Pa mashaka mhanu, mtambika mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu Ananiya kingiriti Kaisariya pamwera na wazewi wamu na wakili yumu gwa malagaliru yawamshema Teritulu. Wamgendiriti mkulu wa mkowa ulii wamgambira mashitaka gawu kuusu Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Paulu wamshemiti, na Teritulu kamlavilira mashitaka hangu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Mtuwa Felisi, ulonguziya waku uherepa ujega ponga nkulu na kwa ulolera waku vitwatira vivuwa vitulwa weri toziya ya isi yetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Shaka shoseri na pahala poseri, kwa ntambu zoseri, mtuwa Felisi, tuvyanka vitwatira vyoseri avi kwa mayagashii gavuwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Kumbiti, bila kuhowiziya shaka shaku nentu, tukuluwa kwa viheri vyaku, guyipikiniri isi yetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Tuyambula handa muntu ayu ndo mbaya nentu. Yomberi katenda ndewu pakati pa Wayawudi kila pahala pasipanu na viraa ndo mlongoziya gwa shama shilii sha Wanazareti. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Kayi kajeriti kuyihalibisiya numba nkulu ya kumluwira Mlungu, natwenga tumkamliti. Tufiriti kumtoza kugenderana na malagaliru getu twaweni. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Kumbiti Lusiya, mkulu gwa majengeni, kingiriti pakati, kamtoliti kwa likakala kulawa mmawoku getu. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Handa pagumgambira msitaki gwakuwi kiza kulongolu kwaku, Handa pagumkosiya gumweni guweza kuvimana vitwatira vyoseri avi vyatumsitakiti kwa vyeni.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Na Wayawudi wajimira shisoweru sha masitaka aga pawatakula handa goseri aga gaweriti nakaka.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu kankujiteteya paulongulu ya Felisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Su, mkulu gwa mkowa kamlekiziiti Paulu katakuli. Nayomberi Paulu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Nemelera kujiteteya paulongolu paku panuvimana handa guwera mtoza gwa maisi aga kwa vinja vivuwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Guweza kujiakishiya handa nentu ndiri ya mashaka ligumba na mawili hera gapita kwanjira pang'enditi kuguwira Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Wayawudi wamona ndiri panalitakuziyana na muntu yoseri wamona ndiri panuwasongiziya wantu mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, pota munumba zya Milungu yawu. Pota pahala pingi kayi poseri mlushi alu. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Pota waweza ndili kulanguziya mashitaka wagalaviyiti kuusu neni. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Shanjimira paulongolu paku ndo hashi. Neni numjimira Mlungu gwa wazewi wetu pandama kugenderana na njira ilii yeni womberi wayishema shama sha ufyangu. Njimira vitwatira vyoseri vyawalembiti muvintola vya malagaliru ga Musa na muvintola vya wambuyi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Neni nulitumbira Mlungu, na womberi walitumbira ula vira, handa wantu yawamfiriziya Mlungu na wantu yawamfiriziya ndiri Mlungu, hawazyuki. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Hangu hangangamali mashaka goseri kuwera na nfiru heri paulongolu pa Mlungu na palongolu pa wantu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Pantamiti kutali kwa vinja vyamaha, mbuyiti Yerusalemu su kuwajegera wantu wa lushi lwangu utanga na kulaviya tambiku. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Shaka neni paweriti nankutenda aga su womberi wamoniti neni Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, nweriti ntenditi kala vitwatira vya kulipunga. Panweriti ndiri na lipinga lya wantu ama ndewu yoseri. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Kumbiti kuweriti na Wayawudi wamonga kulawa kumkoa gwa Asiya, hawa watakiwa kuwera panu paulongolu pakuwi na kulavia masitaka gawu handa wana shoseri sha kunsitakira. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Ama, guwaleki awa wawawera panu watakuli likosa lyawaliwoniti kwaneni shaka pang'olukiti paulongolu pashiyotera motu shawu shikulu, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />payiweri hera visoweru avi vyantakuliti pang'olukiti paulongulu pawu, ‘Mlungu kantozi ulaleru toziya ya kukolera handa wahowiti hawazyukisiwi.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Panu, Felisi, yomberi mweni kaweriti kayimana njira ayi weri, kahayilishiti kesi ayi. Kawagambira, “Navinu hantozi kesi ayi shaka Lusiya, mkulu gwa wanjagila, pakiza panu.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Shakapanu kamwimiziya mkulu gwa wanjagila kamtuli Paulu mshibetubetu, kumbiti kaweri na ulekiziwu shiyasi na waganja wakuwi kotukuwabera pawamupanana shakafira.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu paulongolu pa Felisi na Drusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Pa mashaka madidini, Felisi kiziti pamwera na mdala gwakuwi Drusila yomberi kiweriti Myawudi. Kaamuiti Paulu wamjegi, kampikanira pakayowera kuusu kumjimira Yesu Kristu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Kumbiti shaka Paulu pakanjiti kuyowera kuusu shashimfiriziya Mlungu, kuusu kulikolamlima na kuusu lishaka ya kutoza lyaliyiza. Felisi katiriti na kulonga, “Vinu guweza kugenda, hanukushemi kayi pampata lupenyu.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Shaka shirashi kaweriti kankulitumba handa Paulu kangamupiti shuma. Toziya ayi kamshemiti Paulu mala kwa mala na kuyowera nayu.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Pa vinja miwili avi, Porikiu Festu katoliti lupenyu lwa Felisi, kaweri mkulu gwa mkowa. Toziya kafiriti kulijegelera kwa Wayawudi, Felisi kamlekiti Paulu mshibetubetu.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Paulu katola shibali sha kugenda kulongolu Kayisari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Pa mashaka matatu kwingira kumkoa, Festu kalawiti kaisariya kagenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Watambika wakulu pamwera na walongoziya wa Shiyawudi wampiti shisoweru kuusu mashitaka gakaweriti naga Paulu. Wamluwiti Festu. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Kawatenderi shitwatira shiheri kwa kumjega Paulu Yerusalemu. Waweriti watenda mpangu wamlagi pakawera mnjira. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Kumbiti Festu kankula “Paulu hakasigali mshibetubetu kulii Kaisariya na neni hang'endi aku ulavinu. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Muwaleki walongu wenu wagendi haku pamwera naneni wagalavii mashitaka gawu kuusu yomberi handa katenda shoseri shidoda.” <verse eid="ACT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Festu katamiti nawu kwa shaka sha mashaka msheshi ama ligumba, shakapanu kawuya Kaisariya. Shirawu yakuwi kalikala pa kutozera, kaamuwa Paulu wamjegi pashiyotera motu . <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Shaka Paulu pakiziti, Wayawudi waweriti walawa Yerusalemu wamzyengikiti wanjiti kulaviya masitaka gavuwa geni waweziti ndiri kugalanguziya. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Kwa kujiteteya, Paulu katakuliti, “Neni ndenda ndiri likosa lyoseri kuusu Malagaliru ga Wayawudi, pota kuusu numba nkulu ya kumluwa Mlungu, pota kumhusu Kayisari.” <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Festu kafiriti kulijegelera kwa Wayawudi na hangu kamkosiya Paulu, “Hashi, gufira ng'endi Yerusalemu na aku wakakutozi kulongolu kwaneni kuusu masitaka aga?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paulu kankula, “Nankugoloka palongolu pa shiyotera motu sha Kayisari, na palaa panu ndo nfiruwa kutozwa. Handa ntambu yaguvimana mweni, nuwatendera ndiri Wayawudi vidoda vyoseri. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Su, payiwera neni wera na likosa lyanfiruwa azabu ya kuhowa, nduwa ndiri mundekiziyi azabu ayi. Kumbiti handa kwahera unakaka pakati pamasitaka gawalaviyiti wantu awa, kwahera yakaweza kuntula neni kwa womberi. Ng'enda kulongolu kwa Kayisari!” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Su, pa Festu kuyowera na washawuli wakuwi, kamgambira Paulu, “Gufira kugenda kwa Kayisari, su, gugendi kwa Kayisari.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu kulongolu kwa Agiripa na Beriniki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Pamberi pa mashaka gavuwa ndiri, Mtuwa Agiripa na Beriniki wasokiti Kaisariya su kulaviya ligoya lyawu kwa Festu. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Waweriti aku mashaka ng'o, Festu kamgambira mfalumi masitaka ga Paulu, “Kwana muntu yumu panu mweni Felisi kamtatiriti. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Pangenditi Yerusalemu watambika wakulu wa numba ya Mlungu na wazewi wa Shiyawudi wamsitakiti na kunduwa numtozi. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Kumbiti neni ntakuliti handa shitiba shetu ndiri Warumi kumlaviya muntu kaazibiwi pamberi pa msitakiwa hakeniliwoni na wasitaki wakuwi shinaga ubaga na kumupa lupenu lwa kujiteteya kuusu masitaka aga. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Su, pawasokiti panu, nkawa ndiri, su tuliwoniti pashiyotera motu shirawu yakuwi, himiziya muntu ayu wamjegi. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Wasitaki wakuwi wagolokiti kumbiti walaviya ndiri masitaka madoda handa ntambu yanweriti nankulolera. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ira hera nweriti na likakatala nentu pamwera nayomberi kuusu dini yawu na kuusu muntu yumu yawamshema Yesu yomberi kahowiti, kumbiti Paulu kankukololera handa kamkomu. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Neni maniti ndiri shakutenda kuusu shauli ali. Su, numkosiyiti Paulu handa kafira ng'endi kushiyotera motu Yerusalemu kulii kwaajili ya masitaka aga. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Kumbiti Paulu kendereyiti kulongolu, kaluwa walekiziyi mshibetubetu mpaka uwamuzi wa shitwatira ashi utendwi na Kayisari hangu amuwiti kalikali mshibetubetu mpaka paweza kumjega kwa Kayisari.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Su, Agiripa kamgambira Festu, “Nfira kumpikinira muntu ayu neni namweni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">“Hagumpikiniri shirawu.” Festu kamgambira<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu paulongolu pa Agiripa na Beriniki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Hangu, shirawu yakuwi, Agiripa na Beriniki wiziti kwa nemeleru pakati pamdamu gwa kuliwona waweriti walikola na wakulu wa wanjagila na walongoziya wa lushi. Festu kaamuwiti Paulu wamjegi mnumba. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Festu kalongiti, “Mfalumi Agiripa na woseri wawaweriti panu pamwera na twenga! Panu paulongolu penu kwana muntu yomberi shipinga shoseri sha Wayawudi panu na Yerusalemu kulii wanalamikiriti pawatenda umatu handa kafiruwa kayi ndiri kuwera ukomu. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Kumbiti neni mona handa kaweriti katenda ndiri shoseri shidoda ata kafiruwa wampanani azabu ya kumlaga. Kumbiti Paulu mweni kendeleyiti kulongolu kwa Kayisari, amuwiti wamjegi. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Kwa uwega waneni nahera visoweru kamili vyeni weza kumlembera Kayisari kuusu yomberi. Ina mana numjega panu palongolu penu na palongolu paku mfalumi Agiripa, su pawamshunguziti kala, nwezi kuwera na shakulemba. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Kwa mana iwezekana ndiri kumjega mtatilwa pota kukanta likosa shinaga ubaga.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Paulu kankujiteteya paulongolu pa Agripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Su, Agiripa kamgambira Paulu, “Gulekeziwa kujiteteya.” Panu Paulu kanyoshiti liwoku lyakuwi kujiteteya hangu. <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />Mtuwa Agiripa, nuliwona nana mota leru kujiteteya panlongulu paku kuusu masitaka goseri aga geni Wayawudi waweriti watakula kuusu neni. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Asa toziya gumweni gwenga ndo mwana malifa gwa ntambu za Wayawudi na migogolu yawu, nukuluwa su gumpikiniri kwa uhepelera. <verse eid="ACT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Wayawudi wavimana shisoweru sha makaliru gangu kwanjira uwananguta, mtambu yandamiti kwanjira kwanja pakati pa isi yangu aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Wavimana kwa shaka shitali, na waweza kupitawulira, handa pawafira, handa kwanjira mwanzu ndamiti handa yumu gwa shipinga shana siyasa ikalipa nentu mudini yetu, yani shipinga sha Mafalisayu. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Na vinu na panu ntozwi toziya nulitumbira kwayidi kulii kweni Mlungu kawalagiliti wambuyi wetu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Lagilu ali ndo liraa lilii lyalitumbirwa na makabila lilongu na mbili lya maisi getu, wankumtendera Mlungu kwa nakaka paliwala na pashiru. Mtuwa mfalumi, Wayawudi wankunzitaki toziya ya litumbiru ali! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Kwa shishi mwenga mwona tabu nentu kujimira handa Mlungu kawazyukisiyaga yawahowiti? <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Nakaka neni namweni njimiriti handa ndo lihengu lyangu kutenda vitwatira vivuwa kulirema litawu lya Yesu gwa Nazareti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Shitwatira ashi ndo shantenditi aku Yerusalemu. Neni namweni mpatiti uwezu kulawa kwa Watambika wakulu, mpatiti kuwatula mushibetubetu wavua wa wantu wa Mlungu. Nawomberi pawatozitwi kuwahowiziya, ngalambuziiti simbi za kujimira. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Ntambu yimonga neni ng'enditi munumba za Mlungu panagalira womberi wazibiwi, naneni panjera kwa makakala wayigilangi njimiru yawu. Maya gangu gaweriti makulu nentu kwawomberi ata ng'enditi kuwatabisiya mlushi za patali.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu kankulonga ntambu yakawukiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Kwa nfiru iraa ayi, ng'enditi Dameski shaka shimu, neni nweriti na utuwa na malagiliru kulawa kwa Watambika Wakulu. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Mheshimiwa, shaka panweriti mnjira, saa sita paliwala, moniti uweru mkulu kuliku wa mshenji pawuyaka kulawa kumpindi, uzyengeta neni na walii waweriti wanamwanja wayangu. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Twawoseri twenga tuguwiti pasi, naneni mpikanira liziwu ling'ambira kwa Shiebraniya, ‘Sauli, Sauli! Kwa shishi gundenda? Gulitenda hera handa ng’ombi yakaguma liteki fimbu ya mtuwa gwakuwi.” <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Neni nkosiyiti, “ ‘Gwee gwa gaa Mtuwa?’ Mtuwa kankula, ‘Neni ndo Yesu mweni gwenga gwaguntabisiya. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Gwimuki vinu, gugoloki. Nukulawira su nukutuli nakamu guweri ntumintumi gwangu. Guwalanguziyi wantu wamonga vitwatira vyaguviwoniti lelu na vilii vyeni vyankali hanukulanguziyi. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Hanukulopoziyi na wantu wa Israeli na wantu wa Israeli na wantu wa maisi gamonga geni neni nukulagiliri kwawomberi. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Hagugatumuliziyi masu gawu na kuwatenda womberi walawi muluwindu na kwingira muwulangala, walawi mumakakala ga Shetani na wamgalambukiri Mlungu su wapati ulekiziwu wa vidoda vyawatenditi na wapati uhala pakati pawu kwa walii yawapungitwi kwa njimiru yaiwera kwaneni.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu kankuyowera kuusu untumintumi wakuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Hangu, Mtuwa Agiripa weza ndiri kuweri mkaidi kwa mawonu aga ga kumpindi. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ila nyanjiti kubwera kwanja kwa wantu wa Dameski, shakapanu kwa walii wa Yerusalemu na isi yoseri ya Yudeya, na viraa kwa wantu wa maisi gamonga. Nuwahimiziyiti wamgalambukiri Mlungu na kulangalira kwa vitendu handa waleka vidoda vyawu vyawatenditi. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Toziya ayi, Wayawudi wankamuliti paweriti Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, wajeriti kunaga. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Kumbiti Mlungu kandangiti, na avi mpaka mashaka ga lelu ngoloka ugangamala panavia lulangaliru kwa woseri, wakulu na wadidini. Gatakula ndo galii geni wambuyi na Musa watakuliti hagalawiri. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Yani kafiruwa Kristu katabiki na kaweri gwa kwanja kuzyuka kulawa kwa wahowiti, su wabweri handa uweru wa ulopoziya uwalangalira vinu wantu woseri, Wayawudi na viraa wantu wawawera ndiri wayawudi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Paulu pakayiziti panu mukujiteteya kwakuwi, Festu katakuliti kwa liziwu likulu, “Paulu! Gwana lukwali! Kubetula kwaku kuvuwa kukujegera lukwali!”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Kumbiti Paulu katakula, “Nahera lukwali mtuwa Festu. Shantakula ndo nakaka hera. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Gwenga Mfalumi guvimana vitwatira avi, hangu weza kuyowera pota lyoga palongolu paku. Nahera shashatika handa malawiru aga gamanika kwakuwi toziya shitwatira ashi shitendeka ndiri kwakulififa. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Mfalumi Agiripa, hashi, gwana njimiru na wambuyi? Nuvimana handa gujimira.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agiripa kamwankula Paulu, “Mushaka shididini hera, hashi gulihola haguntendi nweri Mkristu?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paulu kamwankula, “Nankumluwa Mlungu handa, kwa katepu ama shaka shitali, gwenga ndiri hera ila woseri yawampikinira leru wapati kuwera ntambu yanwera neni, kumbiti pota minyololu ayi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Panu Mfalumi Agiripa, mkulu wa mkowa, Beriniki na woseri walii wawaweriti pamwera nawomberi, wagolokiti. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Pawawukiti kala, waligambiziyana, “Muntu ayu katenda ndiri shoseri shashifiruwa azabu ya kumlaga ama kutatirwa.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Yomberi Agiripa kamgambira Festu, “muntu ayu kaweza kuyopolwa handa mekaweriti ndiri kakata lufaa kwa Kayisari.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Paulu kamwanja kugenda Rumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Pawaamuwiti kala twendereyiti na mwanja mpaka Italiya, wamtuliti Paulu pamwera na watatirwa wanonga pasi pa ulolera wa Yuliu yakaweriti mkulu gwa mashonta pakati shipinga yawashishema “shipinga sha Augustu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Tukweniti uwatu mkulu ya Adiramitu iweriti yangugenda na kupitira bandali zimu za mkowa gwa Asiya, tuyanja mwanja. Alisitariku, mwenikaya gwa Makedoniya kulawa Tesaloniki, kaweriti pamwera natwenga. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Shirawu yakuwi tusulusiyi nanga pakati pa bandali ya sidoni. Yuliu kamtendiriti Paulu viheri kwa kumluusu kawawoni waganja wakuwi na kumpanana nfiru zyakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Kulawa aku twendereyiti na mwanja, kumbiti kuweriti na lihega liweriti lyankuvuma kwa kanongola nentu kutuyizira kwa ulongolu, tupitiliti uwega wa shisiwa sha kupiru kweni lihega liweriti livuwa ndiri. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Shakapanu tulokiti bahali ya kilikiya na Pamfiliya, tusulusiiti nanga Mura, lushi lya Lukiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Panu afisa ulii kawoniti uwatu mkulu yimu ya Alekizandiriya yaiweriti yankugenda Italiya, na hangu katukweniziya twingira mngati mwakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Tugenditi mpolimpoli kwa mashaka gavuwa na kwa ntabiku tusokiti pakwegera na Kenidu. Toziya lihega liweriti lyankali lyankutukoma, tupitira uwega wa kushana kushisiwa sha Kireti, kugenda Salumoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Tupititi pambeku yakuwi mpolimpoli kwa ntabika tuyingiriti pahali pawapashema “Bandali nyanyi,” pakwegera na lushi lwa Laseya. <verse eid="ACT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Shaka shivuwa shipititi, na hata mashaka ga kulikala pota kuliya gaweriti gaperiti kala. Vinu iweriti atali nentu kugenda na uwatu mkulu. Su, Paulu kawayupiti moyu, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Watuwa, nulihola handa mwanja agu haguweri gwa ntabiku na kwa asala ivuwa kwa memiziwu ya uwatu mkulu hera, ila viraa kwa makaliru getu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Kumbiti afisa ulii kakwegitwi nentu na maholu ga nahoza na ga mweni kana uwatu mkulu kuliku galii gakatakuliti Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Toziya bandali ayi iweriti ndiri pahala paherepa pa kulivaga shaka sha mbepu, wavuwa wafiriti kwendeleya na mwanja, payiwezekana mpaka Foiniki. Foiniki ndo bandali ya Kireti yaigenda kushana na kwaguzyeta mshenji na kusika na kwaguzyeta mshenji, na aku mewawezi kulivaga shaka sha mbepu.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipuga likalipa mubahali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Su, lihega lyanyanyi lya kusi lyanjiti kuvuma, nawomberi washeriti wapata lengu lyawu. Hangu wawusiya nanga, wendesha uwatu mkulu pakwegera nentu na mpeku ya Kireti. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Kumbiti katepu hera, lihega likalipa lishemwa “Lihega lya kusika” liyanja kuvuma kulawa kushisiwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Lihega liikomiti uwatu mkulu ilii, na toziya tusinditi kulidiwira, tuyileka ijegwijegwi na lihega ali. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Litanda limu lyalishemwa Kauda litupingira shididini kwa liyega lilii, na patupititi kusika mwakuwi tufauliti, iweriti kwa tabu, kusalimisha uwatu gwa uwatu mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Wanamashi walii wagunikiti uwatu mngati, shakapanu wayizyengetiziya uwatu mkulu ngoyi na kuitawa kwa likakala. Watiriti kuwera mewawezi kugomuluwa pambeku pa Siriti. Hangu wasulusiyiti matanga na kuyileka uwatu mkulu ijegwijegwi na lihega. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Lipuga lyendereyiti kuvuma na shirawu yakuwi wayanja kuyasa kunja shehena ya uwatu mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Lishaka lya tatu, wayanja viraa kuyasa mmashi vintu vya uwatu mkulu kwa mawoku gawu weni. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kwa shaka sha mashaka gatangala tuweza ndiri kuwona mshenji ama ntondi, lipuga lyendereyiti kuvuma nentu, ata litumbiru lyoseri lya kuponeka litupera.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Pa kulivaga shaka shitali pota kuliya shiboga, Paulu kagolokiti pakati pawu, katakula, “Waheshimiwa, meyiweriti mbaka handa mungampikiniriti na kuleka mwanja kulawa Kireti handa mngatenditi hangu metushapili tabu ayi na asala zoseri azi. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Kumbiti vinu nankuwaluweni muweri na moyu, kwahera hata yumu gwenu mekahowiziyi ukomu wakuwi, uwatu mkulu hera ndo haiyagamili. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Toziya lishu ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa ulii Mlungu mweni neni ndo gwakuwi na yomberi neni numguwira kandawiliti, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />kang'ambira, ‘Paulu, kotukutira! Mpaka hagugoloki pawulongolu pa Kayisari, na Mlungu, kwa lusungu lyakuwi kakutangi kwa kuwalopoziya woseri wawagenda mwanja na gwenga.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Hangu, wahishimiwa, mulipanani moyu! Toziya numjimira Mlungu kuweri hayiweri teratera ntambu yawang'ambiriti. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Kumbiti ndo mpaka hatuyaswi kumpeku kushisiwa tunga.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Pashiru pa lishaka lya lilongu na msheshi tuweriti twankukwegwa aku na aku mubahali ya Adria. Pakwegera na pashiru nentu, washima miuwatu waliholiti kuwera wapakwegera na isi iyuma. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Hangu wasakuliti utali wa bahari kwa kusulusiya lugoyi lwawatawiti shintu shitopa, wapata utali wa mita malongu msheshi. Shakapanu wapima kayi wapata mita malongu matatu. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Toziya ya kutila kugomuluwa mumatalawu, wasulusiyiti nanga msheshi kumpeli kuuwatu mkulu, waluwa kushii kanongola. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Wanamashi wafiriti kushapira, na wasulusiyiti kala uwatu mmashi, walipayira handa wagenda kusulusiya nanga uwega wa kulongolu kwa uwatu mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Kumbiti Paulu kamgambiriti mkulu gwa jeshi ulii na wanjagila wakuwi, “Handa wanamashi awa hapeni wasigali mngati mwa uwatu, hapeni mlopoziwi.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Panu wanjagila walii wazidumuliti ngoyi zyaziweriti zikolera uwatu, waguleka gutolwi na mashi.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Pakwegera na mandawira, Paulu kawahimiziyiti woseri walii shiboga “Kwa mashaka lilongu na msheshi vinu muwera mumashashatiku na pota kuliya, hamweni lii shintu shoseri. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Su, nuwaluwa mlii shiboga toziya mshifira su muwezi kwendeleya kulikala. Toziya ata viri yimu mumituwi yenu hapeni yagamiri” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Pakatakulita kala hangu, Paulu katoliti libumunda, kalonga maya ga shi Mlungu pamberi pa woseri, kaumega, kanja kuliya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Panu woseri wapata moyu, na womberi vila waliya shiboga. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Woseri waweriti wantu mia mbili na malongu saba na sita muuwatu mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Pa kila yumu kuliya shiboga sha kwikuta, wapunguliti kutopa kwa uwatu mkulu kwa kuyasa viboga mubahari.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meli yankumegeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Pawushiiti, wanamashi wawezandiri kuyimana isi ilii. Ira wawoniti guba yimu yana mpeku, Waamuwa kusulusiya nanga aku handa payiwezikana. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Hangu wazidumuliti nanga na kuzileka mubahari, na shaka shiraa ashi waziyopola ngoyi zaziweriti ziguyopa msukanu, shakapanu wagolosiya tanga yimu palongolu kukola lihega, wagenditi kumpeku. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Kumbiti wasokiti pahali pena mikondu miwili ya bahari iliwona, na uwatu mkulu igomuluwa. Seemu ya palongolu iweriti imiruwa mumhanga pota kutikinyika. Seemu ya kumbeli ya uwatu mkulu iyanjiti kumegeka vipandi vipandi kwa makomangu ga likakala lya makupala. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Wanjagira wafiriti kuwalaga watatirwa woseri kwa kutira handa wankusuga mpaka kumbeku na kutoloka. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Kumbiti toziya afisa jeshi ulii kafiriti kumlopoziya Paulu, kawaberiti nawatenda hangu. Kaamuliti walii yawamana kusuga wakopoki kulawa muuwatu mkulu na kusuga mpaka kumpeku. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Na wamonga wayizi pawalikolilera mumbawu ama muvipandi vya uwatu mkulu vyavimegikiti. Ndo twenga ntambu yatusokiti nyanyi kumpeku.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Yagampatiti Paulu aku Malta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Patusokiti kala nyanyi muisi iyuma, tuvimaniti kuwera shisiwa shilii shishemitwi Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Wenikaya wa palii watutendiriti gaherepa nentu. Vula iweriti yankwanja kutowa na kuweriti na mbepu, su wakoziyiti motu na watushemeriti woseri twenga. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paulu kasoliti shisanka shididini sha mbawu na pakashituliti mumotu, toziya ya livuki lya motu, njoka yakawera na usungu kalawiti mushisanka shilii na kumnyengelera muliwoku lyakuwi. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Wenikaya wa palii pawamuwoniti njoka ulii kalinyengelera muliwoku lya Paulu, su waligambiziyana, “Muntu ayu kalagaga tembera kalopoziwa kulawa mubahali, kuhowa hapeni kumleki kalikali!” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Kumbiti Paulu kampuntiriti njoka ulii mumotu na mweni katenduwitwi ndiri ata padidini. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Wantu waweriti wankulolera mekatutumuki ama mekaguwi na kuhowa. Kumbiti pakwoyera kwa shaka shitangala na kwona kwahera shoseri shashimlawiriti, womberi wagalamburiti maholu gawu na kwanja kulonga kuwera yomberi ndo mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Pakwegera na pahala palii paweriti na malambu ga mkulu gwa shisiwa shilii yakashemitwi Publiu. Yomberi katuwankiti na kututendera kwa moyu guherepa kwa shaka sha mashaka matatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Tati gwakuwi Publiu kagonjiti mushitanda, yomberi kaweriti kapyupa na kupweka mwazi. Paulu kingiriti mnumba su kamwoni na pakaluwa Mlungu, katula mawoku pamlweri na kumponiziya. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Kulawirana na shitwatira ashi, wantu woseri yawalikaliti mushisiwa shilii, walii yawaweriti walweli su wiziti na waponiziwitwi. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Womberi watupananiti ligoya nentu, na twenga patuweriti kala mumwanja kupitira mubahali, womberi watuliti muuwatu vintu vivuwa vyatuvifiriti.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanja kulawa Malta kugenda Rumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Pa miyezi mitatu twanjiti mwanja kayi kwa uwatu mkulu yaigolokiti pashisiwa shilii toziya ya shaka sha mpepu. Meli ayi iweriti ya Alekizandiriya iweriti na alama ya milungu mawira yawashemwa Kasita na Polukisi. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Patusokiti mlushi lwa Sirakusi, tulikaliti aku kwa mashaka matatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Kulawa kulii tugenditi pampeku pa bahari na tusokiti mlushi lwa Regiu. Lishaka lyalifatiti lyega lyalihera makakala lyanjiti kuvuma kulawa kusika, na kwa mwanja gwa mashaka mawili tusokiti mlushi lwa Potioli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Aku tuwawoniti walongu yawatushemiriti tulikali pamuhera nawomberi kwa lijuwa limu. Su twendereyiti na mwanja mpaka tusokiti Rumi. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Walongu wa aku Rumi pawapatiti visoweru vyetu, womberi wiziti kulisoku lya Apiu na pahala papashemwa “mikahawa mitatu” kutwanka. Paulu pakawawoniti, yomberi kalongiti mayagashii Mlungu, su shitwatira ashi shimtenditi kaweriti na moyu.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu mlushi lwa Rumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Patusokiti Rumi, Paulu wamlekeziyiti kulikala gweka yakuwi pakawera na mnjagira yumu gwa kumlolera.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Pa mashaka matatu, Paulu kawashemiti pamuhera wakulu wa Shiyawudi. Pawajojinikiti kala, yomberi kawagambiriti, “Walongu wangu, tembera neni nuwatenda ndiri shitwatira shoseri wantu wetu ama vitiba vya watati wetu kumbiti nkamulitwi aku Yerusalemu na kutulwa mumawoku mwa Warumi. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Pawankosiyiti kala na kuwona nahera shidoda shoseri, womberi wafiriti kulekeziya. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Kumbiti Wayawudi wamonga walemiti shitwatira ashi, neni nazimika kukata lufaa kwa Kayisari tembera neni nweriti ndiri na shoseri sha kuwasitaki wantu wa lushi lwangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Toziya ayi nduwa kuliwona na kuyowera na mwenga, mana ndawalirwa minyololu ayi toziya ya litumbiru lilii lya Israeli.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Womberi wamwankula, “Twenga tuwanka ndiri luhamba lwoseri kulawa Yudeya kuusu gwenga, ama kwahera mlongu yoseri yakiziti panu na kulaviya shisoweru ama kutakula shoseri shidoda kuusu gwenga. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Kumbiti metufiri kupikinira kulawa kwaku shilii shaguhola toziya tuvimana kuwera kila pahala wantu wankutakulira madoda kuusu womberi.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Su pawapangiti lishaka lya kuliwona na womberi, wantu wavuwa wiziti kwanjira mandawira mpaka pamihi Paulu kawagambiriti vitwatira vivuwa na kulaviya ukapitawu kuusu Ufalumi wa Mlungu. Yomberi kajeriti kuwatenda wajimiri shisoweru kuusu Yesu kulawa Mumalagaliru ga Musa na malembu ga wambuyi wa Mlungu. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Wamonga wawu wajimiriti shisoweru shakuwi kumbiti wamonga wajimira ndiri. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Su womberi wajimilirana ndiri, na pawayanjiti kuwuka, Paulu katakuliti shitwatira shimu, “Rohu Mnanagala katakuliti nakaka na watati wenu palii kupitira Isaya mbuyi gwa Mlungu, <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Pakalongiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Gugendi kwa wantu awa na gukawagambiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">kupikinira hampikiniri, kumbiti hapeni mwerewi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">kulola hamloli, kumbiti hapeni mwoni.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Toziya myoyu ya wantu awa iwera ikamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na makutu gawu gadiwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">womberi wawona ndiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Pamonga womberi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">mewaloli kwa masu gawu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na mewapikaniri kwa makutu gawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">mewavimani kwa myoyu yawu na mewang'alambukiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na neni meniwaponiziyi.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />“Su neni nfira mwenga muvimani kuwera ulopoziya wa Mlungu ujegwa kwa wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi na womberi hawapikiniri!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Na yomberi pakatakuliti kala visoweru avi, Wayawudi wawuka pawawera na visoweru mumyoyu mwawu.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Kwa shaka sha vinja viwili vyoseri Paulu kalikaliti kulaa pakaya pakapangiti mweni, kaweriti kankuwashemera woseri yawasokiti kumulamsiya. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Kwa ugangamala na pota na lyoga yomberi kaweriti kankuwubwera Ufalumi wa Mlungu na kufunda kuusu Mtuwa Yesu Kristu.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>